<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:05.840" end="00:00:07.040" style="s2">This is...</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.840" end="00:00:11.120" style="s2">I&#39;m Head Butler JuJiLuo. This is</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.240" end="00:00:12.320" style="s2">Head Maid AnJing.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.280" end="00:00:16.280" style="s2">Sign this, and you&#39;re an official employee of Ravencrest Estate.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.400" end="00:00:19.040" style="s2">Eight-figure monthly salary, bonuses on top of that.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.200" end="00:00:23.120" style="s2">One million!</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.200" end="00:00:26.959" style="s2">I&#39;ve only seen this many zeros in Sichuan City.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.960" end="00:00:29.240" style="s2">I just got transported and I already have a job assignment?</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.400" end="00:00:35.720" style="s2">During the ten-year contract, leaving without permission or offending the master</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.080" end="00:00:38.360" style="s2">counts as a breach. The price is—</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.120" end="00:00:44.240" style="s2">Uncle, stop joking. The Qing Dynasty fell ages ago.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.560" end="00:00:46.640" style="s2">The rules of Ravencrest Estate—</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.360" end="00:00:49.280" style="s2">nobody in Country S would take as a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.120" end="00:00:55.039" style="s2">Ravencrest Estate. Country S. Isn&#39;t this the novel I was reading last night?</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.040" end="00:00:59.599" style="s2">Wait, don&#39;t tell me the master of this estate is named—</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.600" end="00:01:00.559" style="s2">FuXiaoTing?</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.560" end="00:01:01.160" style="s2">Watch your mouth.</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.760" end="00:01:04.280" style="s2">You think you can just call the master by his name?</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.760" end="00:01:06.920" style="s2">I... did I get transported into a novel?</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.080" end="00:01:11.119" style="s2">The legendary master of Ravencrest Estate, rich beyond imagination</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.120" end="00:01:13.279" style="s2">Lord Fu, please give me another chance, Lord Fu</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.280" end="00:01:14.360" style="s2">Give me one more chance</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.840" end="00:01:17.719" style="s2">He&#39;s a mute, ruthless killer. Follow him and you may not prosper.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.720" end="00:01:18.320" style="s2">but those who defy him are absolutely doomed</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.200" end="00:01:25.639" style="s2">Um, actually, I&#39;m pregnant and about to go on maternity leave</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.640" end="00:01:29.360" style="s2">I&#39;ll hold up the work. I&#39;ll see myself out, no need to walk me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.440" end="00:01:31.640" style="s2">Your predecessor</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.240" end="00:01:34.280" style="s2">lost her tongue because she lied</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.240" end="00:01:39.080" style="s2">The one before her tried to escape and lost both legs. You</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.440" end="00:01:40.640" style="s2">which part do you not want anymore</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.040" end="00:01:46.640" style="s2">Don&#39;t hold me back, Butler Ji. I absolutely love my job</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.760" end="00:01:50.000" style="s2">For Ravencrest Estate, I&#39;ll sweat and bleed without hesitation</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.160" end="00:01:54.680" style="s2">What the hell is the use of pride? Staying alive is what matters</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.360" end="00:01:58.879" style="s2">System, the lost mind-reading ability</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.880" end="00:02:00.680" style="s2">will it be on this newcomer</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.400" end="00:02:04.519" style="s2">Host, unable to confirm. Host must observe personally</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.520" end="00:02:07.520" style="s2">Once locked, call out. This System will eliminate and retrieve.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.760" end="00:02:09.319" style="s2">I worked so hard to grind FuXiaoTing&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.320" end="00:02:12.439" style="s2">affection level up to twenty-nine and secure the Head Maid position</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.440" end="00:02:14.840" style="s2">No one is allowed to ruin my plan</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.960" end="00:02:18.800" style="s2">There is only one fate for offending Sir. Watch your mouth</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.480" end="00:02:21.200" style="s2">Sir is here</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.240" end="00:02:43.880" style="s2">Sir</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.360" end="00:02:50.000" style="s2">Standing there like wooden posts, one by one. Boring</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.840" end="00:02:55.039" style="s2">Who, who&#39;s talking? That voice, it seems to be coming from</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.040" end="00:02:57.080" style="s2">that FuXiaoTing&#39;s direction</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.200" end="00:02:58.160" style="s2">Isn&#39;t he supposed to be mute</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.360" end="00:03:00.320" style="s2">Holy crap</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.800" end="00:03:05.719" style="s2">A goddess-tier face. Obliterates all those plastic surgery clones.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.720" end="00:03:09.080" style="s2">But who was talking just now? Am I hearing things</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.880" end="00:03:14.120" style="s2">Spare me, Sir. I didn&#39;t mean to be late. Shut up</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.240" end="00:03:18.440" style="s2">Ravencrest Rules Number One: Punctuality. Those who offend Sir</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.800" end="00:03:20.000" style="s2">will be dealt with according to the rules</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.200" end="00:03:25.640" style="s2">Spare me, Sir!</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.560" end="00:03:32.360" style="s2">Dragged away. More ruthless than the book.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.480" end="00:03:35.720" style="s2">Eight figures? Burns your life, not just hands.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.000" end="00:03:40.039" style="s2">This is the Head Maid I promoted a few days ago.</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.040" end="00:03:41.840" style="s2">Quick on her feet, at least.</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.560" end="00:03:45.080" style="s2">I heard it again. That&#39;s really his voice.</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.800" end="00:03:48.200" style="s2">Why on earth can I hear this devil&#39;s inner thoughts?</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.920" end="00:03:51.319" style="s2">Congratulations, Host. FuXiaoTing&#39;s affection level has increased.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.320" end="00:03:55.159" style="s2">Current affection level: thirty percent. Keep it up. Three years—</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.160" end="00:03:58.159" style="s2">Finally hit thirty. And ruled out another wrong option.</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.160" end="00:04:00.439" style="s2">Better to kill by mistake than let one slip.</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.440" end="00:04:03.439" style="s2">Once I clean out these lovely maids one by one,</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.440" end="00:04:05.120" style="s2">the mind-reading ability will naturally return to me.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.240" end="00:04:16.280" style="s2">No way, sir. Where did this feather come from? My nose is so itchy.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.320" end="00:04:20.600" style="s2">Sir, this is the new maid.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.560" end="00:04:24.559" style="s2">Hold it in. If I spray snot on his face,</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.560" end="00:04:27.200" style="s2">I&#39;m pre-ordering my coffin. Hold it in!</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.240" end="00:04:30.440" style="s2">Oh no. Can&#39;t hold it anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.200" end="00:04:36.079" style="s2">If this maid dares to sneeze on me, I&#39;ll have her</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.080" end="00:04:37.160" style="s2">fed to the crocodiles.</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.400" end="00:04:41.960" style="s2">Oh God. Wait—this stupid feather. Just pluck it out and it&#39;s done.</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.920" end="00:04:44.719" style="s2">If she dares to lay a finger on me in my presence,</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.720" end="00:04:47.120" style="s2">I&#39;ll send her to Siberia to dig potatoes.</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.840" end="00:04:51.079" style="s2">Is there even a difference, bro? Either way I&#39;m dead meat.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.080" end="00:04:52.520" style="s2">Only one option left.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.840" end="00:05:01.160" style="s2">Quite the glutton, aren&#39;t we?</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.640" end="00:05:09.680" style="s2">Psycho. This guy is a total psycho.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.800" end="00:05:13.520" style="s2">Five a.m. sharp. Assemble on time. Serve Sir his meal.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.120" end="00:05:14.840" style="s2">Dismissed.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.520" end="00:05:18.559" style="s2">YuYang, put away all those</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.560" end="00:05:20.120" style="s2">unwanted thoughts and expressions.</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.960" end="00:05:23.480" style="s2">Sir is not someone you can covet.</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.080" end="00:05:25.520" style="s2">Yes, Butler Ji.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.080" end="00:05:29.479" style="s2">Covet my ass. This godawful job—</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.480" end="00:05:32.719" style="s2">Salary&#39;s hush money for my life. Back then,</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.720" end="00:05:37.040" style="s2">I only trashed the plot. No details remembered.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.520" end="00:05:42.320" style="s2">Thank God—free mind-reading ability included.</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.600" end="00:05:53.120" style="s2">Word is, earlier Xiaoxue brought Sir his coffee</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.240" end="00:05:55.639" style="s2">The water was two degrees too hot, so she got thrown into</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.640" end="00:05:56.960" style="s2">the Fu family waters to feed the fish</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.560" end="00:06:01.400" style="s2">In just one day, we lost two maids</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.320" end="00:06:07.759" style="s2">Ravencrest is terrifying, but one month&#39;s pay here beats ten years outside</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.760" end="00:06:11.240" style="s2">Otherwise, how could I afford such high-end perfume?</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.360" end="00:06:15.079" style="s2">People break their necks trying to get in, let alone</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.080" end="00:06:17.960" style="s2">get noticed by Sir like Sister AnJing did</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.080" end="00:06:19.640" style="s2">and become Head Maid</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.000" end="00:06:23.360" style="s2">High pay, sure—but you gotta be alive to spend it</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.240" end="00:06:29.000" style="s2">Hey girl, your perfume smells amazing</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.480" end="00:06:32.480" style="s2">I wanna buy some daily supplies too, you know</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.840" end="00:06:33.800" style="s2">how do I get out of here?</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.640" end="00:06:36.200" style="s2">You&#39;re new here</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.040" end="00:06:41.000" style="s2">Ravencrest is locked down tight, but there is a way out</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.600" end="00:06:41.960" style="s2">How?</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.720" end="00:06:47.120" style="s2">In a body bag—you&#39;ll get carried out</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.680" end="00:06:50.479" style="s2">Yeah, I&#39;ll keep that one to myself, thanks</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.480" end="00:06:53.600" style="s2">I&#39;m not here to make friends. If we get along, great. If not, whatever</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.840" end="00:06:56.960" style="s2">What&#39;s with the attitude? You dare throw that at me, Xiaoyue?</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.560" end="00:07:01.399" style="s2">Ravencrest forbids infighting. You do know that, right, Sister An?</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.400" end="00:07:05.360" style="s2">It&#39;s all a misunderstanding. Xiaoyue&#39;s just hot-tempered. Don&#39;t hold it against her</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.720" end="00:07:08.480" style="s2">Ravencrest has dedicated staff for monthly procurement. When the time comes</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.720" end="00:07:10.280" style="s2">just send me your supply list</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.640" end="00:07:11.720" style="s2">Thanks, Sister An</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.400" end="00:07:17.359" style="s2">The original owner was flat broke—no money to buy anything. Otherwise</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.360" end="00:07:20.719" style="s2">she wouldn&#39;t have sold herself to this hellhole. But</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.720" end="00:07:24.080" style="s2">this Head Maid AnJing actually seems pretty reasonable</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.160" end="00:07:26.360" style="s2">We should help each other out—it&#39;s only right</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.800" end="00:07:28.880" style="s2">Get some rest</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.720" end="00:07:37.039" style="s2">The book says Country S is full of tangled factions and making money here is no joke.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.040" end="00:07:40.640" style="s2">Gotta plan my escape properly, or I&#39;ll just starve out there.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.120" end="00:07:44.720" style="s2">Good thing I can hear that man&#39;s inner thoughts now.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.320" end="00:07:48.800" style="s2">I&#39;ll gamble on it — tough out one month, get the cash, then figure out my getaway.</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.280" end="00:07:53.719" style="s2">By then, I&#39;m buying a big house and keeping ten male models.</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.720" end="00:07:55.280" style="s2">Just lying around enjoying life every damn day.</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.880" end="00:08:01.279" style="s2">Damn it! I just got this mind-reading ability...</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.280" end="00:08:03.080" style="s2">and I lose it before I even get to use it!</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.400" end="00:08:07.400" style="s2">System, are you sure the mind-reading ability is here in the estate?</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.000" end="00:08:11.239" style="s2">I&#39;ve been searching for days. This System never lies.</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.240" end="00:08:13.519" style="s2">Keep at it, Host. Get the mind-reading ability back...</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.520" end="00:08:15.319" style="s2">so you can capture FuXiaoTing ASAP...</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.320" end="00:08:17.120" style="s2">and become the lady of Ravencrest Estate!</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.320" end="00:08:19.040" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.120" end="00:08:21.920" style="s2">Tomorrow morning — anything I need to watch out for?</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.520" end="00:08:23.599" style="s2">System has detected...</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.600" end="00:08:24.919" style="s2">tomorrow morning FuXiaoTing will be in a foul mood.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.920" end="00:08:27.679" style="s2">Host should prepare a calming herbal tea.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.680" end="00:08:29.840" style="s2">Success earns you two affection points.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.440" end="00:08:37.280" style="s2">Six o&#39;clock.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.120" end="00:08:39.320" style="s2">Just ten more minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.080" end="00:08:42.800" style="s2">Six o&#39;clock!</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.280" end="00:08:47.000" style="s2">Five a.m. sharp, assemble on time. Serve Sir his meal.</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.320" end="00:08:50.600" style="s2">What the hell! Who messed with my alarm?</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.640" end="00:09:05.119" style="s2">Brewed tea with dew I collected all night. Sir&#39;s affection for me...</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.120" end="00:09:05.840" style="s2">is locked in.</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.960" end="00:09:10.400" style="s2">YuYang, why are you so late?</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.520" end="00:09:12.680" style="s2">Lucky Sir came in late today, otherwise...</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.440" end="00:09:20.720" style="s2">YuYang. Late by sixty-one minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.840" end="00:09:24.680" style="s2">Half a month&#39;s wages docked. Next time — both your feet.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.880" end="00:09:26.240" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.320" end="00:09:30.199" style="s2">Good thing this lazy bastard is a slacker. His old man...</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.200" end="00:09:31.640" style="s2">Who the hell set me up on purpose?</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.760" end="00:09:48.080" style="s2">She&#39;s playing games while we&#39;re doomed.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.960" end="00:09:57.560" style="s2">Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.520" end="00:10:01.159" style="s2">Running an empire this big, and he&#39;s up before six every damn day.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.160" end="00:10:03.559" style="s2">I just wanna sleep in for once.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.560" end="00:10:06.679" style="s2">You dog of a man—we&#39;re up at five because of you!</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.680" end="00:10:09.080" style="s2">If you just dropped dead, then you could sleep all you want.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.160" end="00:10:11.360" style="s2">Breakfast is served.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.600" end="00:10:20.120" style="s2">This stuff back home, I wouldn&#39;t even feed it to the chickens.</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.680" end="00:10:23.959" style="s2">Gotta choke it down anyway. Isn&#39;t self-discipline supposed to be about</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.960" end="00:10:25.040" style="s2">doing the same thing for ten years straight?</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.600" end="00:10:27.560" style="s2">Let&#39;s call it a reward—</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.280" end="00:10:31.399" style="s2">today&#39;s server gets to eat a year&#39;s worth of</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.400" end="00:10:32.840" style="s2">salad. Bon appétit.</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.400" end="00:10:38.000" style="s2">Reward? Please, bro—literally nobody wants that reward.</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.120" end="00:10:41.120" style="s2">Today, which one of you is serving Sir?</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.480" end="00:10:47.240" style="s2">Sorry, sis. You started it, I&#39;m finishing it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.600" end="00:10:48.559" style="s2">Host detected—</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.560" end="00:10:50.720" style="s2">FuXiaoTing&#39;s irritation level rising. Perfect timing.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.960" end="00:10:58.520" style="s2">Ugh, what a waste of hands.</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.000" end="00:11:00.799" style="s2">Oh no. FuXiaoTing&#39;s affection level dropped by five.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.800" end="00:11:02.240" style="s2">Current affection level: twenty-five.</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.200" end="00:11:05.840" style="s2">This bastard—who pissed him off now?</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.800" end="00:11:09.319" style="s2">Kill me. I busted my ass for three years to scrape together ten.</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.320" end="00:11:11.239" style="s2">This little cutie fumbles once and just wipes out</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.240" end="00:11:12.560" style="s2">five affection points for me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.040" end="00:11:16.159" style="s2">Mr. Fu&#39;s grumpy. Let me help.</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.160" end="00:11:16.880" style="s2">No need to thank me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.840" end="00:11:23.360" style="s2">Since you stepped up, you&#39;re it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.440" end="00:11:24.920" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.760" end="00:11:28.639" style="s2">Nice try, kiddo. Playing dirty with me?</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.640" end="00:11:30.560" style="s2">I know every scheme from Empresses.</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.680" end="00:11:35.719" style="s2">What is that smell? How could my estate have</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.720" end="00:11:38.240" style="s2">a maid who reeks like she&#39;s been soaking in a pickle jar?</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.400" end="00:11:41.600" style="s2">How dare she displease Sir?</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.320" end="00:11:43.040" style="s2">Drag her out!</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.160" end="00:11:46.400" style="s2">Sir! Sir, spare my life! Sir! Sir, please spare me!</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.520" end="00:11:47.360" style="s2">Sister An.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.360" end="00:11:52.039" style="s2">This bastard&#39;s nose is way too sharp.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.040" end="00:11:53.600" style="s2">Is she seriously just gonna die like that?</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.720" end="00:11:57.200" style="s2">YuYang, since you were late this morning, you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.560" end="00:11:58.880" style="s2">continue serving Sir his meal.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.320" end="00:12:04.040" style="s2">That Butler Ji is definitely trying to set me up.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.920" end="00:12:09.440" style="s2">Xiaoyue, I looked at YuYang&#39;s checklist—</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.560" end="00:12:11.360" style="s2">it&#39;s full of stuff that breaks the rules.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.080" end="00:12:16.640" style="s2">She&#39;s new, cut her some slack. Talk to her later.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.760" end="00:12:17.840" style="s2">Make her fall in line.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.440" end="00:12:22.760" style="s2">Sister An, you&#39;re too kind. I understand. Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.800" end="00:12:27.559" style="s2">Woman, I was going to test if that mind-reading ability is on you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.560" end="00:12:31.159" style="s2">How dare you ruin my herbal tea! Once you&#39;re disposed of,</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.160" end="00:12:32.120" style="s2">I&#39;ll take my time looking.</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.160" end="00:12:36.199" style="s2">This maid is that greedy little thing from yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.200" end="00:12:39.440" style="s2">A fart blew her hair last night—she looked silly.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.280" end="00:12:43.159" style="s2">Forget it, forget it. I won&#39;t stoop to a psycho&#39;s level.</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.160" end="00:12:45.440" style="s2">She looks even uglier when she smiles.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.520" end="00:12:53.720" style="s2">It&#39;s just a bowl of salad—what&#39;s there to serve? Completely pointless.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.960" end="00:13:11.000" style="s2">Looks like Sir&#39;s appetite is still bad today.</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.840" end="00:13:12.440" style="s2">Take it away.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.240" end="00:13:19.279" style="s2">No wonder this alpha&#39;s got such a rotten temper.</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.280" end="00:13:22.520" style="s2">Severely carb-deficient—of course he&#39;s gonna explode.</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.720" end="00:13:27.680" style="s2">A bunch of useless trash—can&#39;t even make a single edible dish.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.240" end="00:13:30.320" style="s2">Since that&#39;s the case...</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.520" end="00:13:36.320" style="s2">What&#39;s that lunatic up to now?</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.680" end="00:13:46.760" style="s2">Sir wants to play a game. The winner gets this month&#39;s salary...</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.000" end="00:13:47.720" style="s2">doubled.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.840" end="00:13:48.800" style="s2">For real?</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.760" end="00:13:52.639" style="s2">Sister An said Sir&#39;s orders have never been a bluff.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.640" end="00:13:54.560" style="s2">I have to find a way to win.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.240" end="00:13:59.719" style="s2">After deducting this morning&#39;s fine, that&#39;s a net gain of one-fifty grand.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.720" end="00:14:01.400" style="s2">Who&#39;d ever complain about easy money?</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.120" end="00:14:04.399" style="s2">You little cuties, even without mind-reading ability,</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.400" end="00:14:07.279" style="s2">I can&#39;t hear Sir&#39;s inner thoughts, but I&#39;ve got the System&#39;s alerts.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.280" end="00:14:08.480" style="s2">You really think you can compete with me?</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.000" end="00:14:17.480" style="s2">Looks like it&#39;s a fruit-eating contest. Sorry, sisters.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.720" end="00:14:21.679" style="s2">I won second place in my neighborhood&#39;s big eater challenge. This competition...</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.680" end="00:14:23.119" style="s2">I&#39;m winning this for sure.</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.120" end="00:14:25.519" style="s2">Now, start picking your fruit.</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.520" end="00:14:26.840" style="s2">Pick fruit? What for?</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.160" end="00:14:31.279" style="s2">Grab the most eye-catching fruit to show your courage and uniqueness.</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.280" end="00:14:32.720" style="s2">Attract the male lead&#39;s attention.</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.440" end="00:14:35.240" style="s2">Most eye-catching...</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.040" end="00:14:50.839" style="s2">Are these people locusts? Perfect, I&#39;ll eat it in one bite. Easy.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.840" end="00:14:53.600" style="s2">Good. Now, balance them on your heads.</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.080" end="00:14:55.400" style="s2">On our heads?</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.720" end="00:14:59.000" style="s2">The flying knife game starts now.</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.520" end="00:15:05.720" style="s2">No way.</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.560" end="00:15:10.880" style="s2">Fu Xiao Ting!</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.160" end="00:15:14.359" style="s2">I&#39;m gonna kill you!</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.360" end="00:15:15.200" style="s2">Hurry up!</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.680" end="00:15:26.480" style="s2">Balance this my ass!</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.040" end="00:15:32.120" style="s2">How is this thing supposed to stay stable? A fart could blow it right off.</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.000" end="00:15:39.800" style="s2">Bored all morning, and finally the game begins.</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.400" end="00:15:43.400" style="s2">Thank God the System picked the biggest one for me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.120" end="00:15:45.920" style="s2">This will definitely catch Sir&#39;s attention.</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.080" end="00:16:25.760" style="s2">Seeking out a third party on her own. This little glutton actually has some nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.240" end="00:16:28.879" style="s2">If I&#39;m really guilty, then let the law judge me</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.880" end="00:16:32.239" style="s2">with an iron fist of justice, not leave me here as a sitting duck.</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.240" end="00:16:37.160" style="s2">You dog of a man, see that? I&#39;m smiling at you. Aim carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.880" end="00:16:42.440" style="s2">Smiling. Provoking me. Fine. Have it your way.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.480" end="00:16:50.600" style="s2">Wait, where is he even aiming? This guy&#39;s got serious issues. Help!</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.280" end="00:17:01.880" style="s2">Too ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.720" end="00:17:06.319" style="s2">How can this woman be this stupid? Finally, Ravencrest Estate has</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.320" end="00:17:08.000" style="s2">something entertaining to pass the time.</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.120" end="00:17:11.119" style="s2">Sir is shaking with rage. We&#39;re doomed.</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.120" end="00:17:12.920" style="s2">Looks like she&#39;s about to be gone for good.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.760" end="00:17:16.759" style="s2">This psycho thinks I&#39;m not dead enough and wants to finish me off.</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.760" end="00:17:18.920" style="s2">Sir, he&#39;s asking your name.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.240" end="00:17:23.719" style="s2">I&#39;ve been here so long and Sir hasn&#39;t even glanced at me properly.</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.720" end="00:17:25.400" style="s2">And yet he&#39;s actually asking her name first.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.720" end="00:17:27.800" style="s2">Answer Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.400" end="00:17:29.840" style="s2">My name is YuYang.</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.200" end="00:17:34.399" style="s2">Dizzy Sheep? What kind of garbage name is that? Of course she&#39;s just a</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.400" end="00:17:36.440" style="s2">dizzy sheep that eats grass and walks into trees.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.640" end="00:17:47.480" style="s2">Game over.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.440" end="00:17:49.400" style="s2">Today&#39;s winner</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.560" end="00:17:54.920" style="s2">YuYang. This month&#39;s salary, doubled.</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.920" end="00:18:02.479" style="s2">As expected of me. Yours truly wore a strawberry and did acrobatics under the blade.</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.480" end="00:18:04.880" style="s2">You think it&#39;s easy earning this hush money?</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.360" end="00:18:10.279" style="s2">Host, FuXiaoTing&#39;s affection level</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.280" end="00:18:15.199" style="s2">dropped another ten. Minus, minus ten? System, are you useless?</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.200" end="00:18:18.440" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you remind me to grab a strawberry from the start, Host?</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.920" end="00:18:21.920" style="s2">Now you&#39;re blaming me? Who knew your hands were that fast?</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.600" end="00:18:27.079" style="s2">Is it a coincidence, or can she hear Sir&#39;s inner thoughts?</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.080" end="00:18:30.319" style="s2">Deliberately picked the smallest fruit. Mind-reading ability</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.320" end="00:18:32.840" style="s2">could it be inside her?</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.600" end="00:18:42.559" style="s2">So sleepy, so hungry... just a few leaves of greens at noon.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.560" end="00:18:44.360" style="s2">Even the biggest cheapskate would cry seeing that.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.160" end="00:18:49.639" style="s2">Good thing I&#39;m clever—swiped a big potato. It&#39;s still warm.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.640" end="00:18:52.280" style="s2">Later I&#39;ll find a corner and enjoy a lovely afternoon tea.</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.720" end="00:18:56.600" style="s2">Did the partner&#39;s brain get slammed by a door or kicked by a donkey?</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.080" end="00:19:00.919" style="s2">This proposal is worse than crap. And this crappy sofa—</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.920" end="00:19:04.400" style="s2">Admin department taking kickbacks—did you buy a coffin with that?</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.520" end="00:19:08.000" style="s2">A bunch of useless trash—every one of you should be fed to the crocodiles.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.600" end="00:19:11.000" style="s2">So irritable—is your menopause coming early?</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.080" end="00:19:15.200" style="s2">So hungry... can they please make something fit for human consumption?</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.280" end="00:19:19.639" style="s2">Eating grass every day—of course you&#39;re hungry. Starve to death, serves you right.</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.640" end="00:19:22.400" style="s2">If anyone could make something delicious right now—</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.120" end="00:19:26.720" style="s2">I&#39;d reward her with three gold bars.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.080" end="00:19:28.160" style="s2">That&#39;s almost two million.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.760" end="00:19:31.279" style="s2">With that getaway money, who&#39;d want to stay in this hellhole?</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.280" end="00:19:35.480" style="s2">Slaving away for a full month—tomorrow. No—tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.600" end="00:19:37.880" style="s2">I&#39;ll crawl through the dog hole and fly far away.</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.720" end="00:19:45.800" style="s2">YuYang, where are you going? Sir hasn&#39;t dismissed you yet.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.760" end="00:19:47.720" style="s2">Sister An.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.320" end="00:19:50.839" style="s2">I noticed Sir seems really hungry. I was thinking—</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.840" end="00:19:52.400" style="s2">Maybe we should bring him something to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.360" end="00:19:56.240" style="s2">Sir has had no appetite lately. Don&#39;t cause trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.080" end="00:20:00.680" style="s2">No appetite? He&#39;s about to starve to death, you know?</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.760" end="00:20:04.640" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll go change the water in the vase.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.520" end="00:20:10.519" style="s2">Suddenly running out like that—could it be</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.520" end="00:20:14.600" style="s2">she heard Sir&#39;s inner thoughts? Chunlai—we can&#39;t keep her anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.600" end="00:20:19.760" style="s2">At the critical moment, I still have to rely on myself.</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.000" end="00:20:21.320" style="s2">Good thing I swiped this at noon.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.920" end="00:20:25.999" style="s2">But just one potato—too pathetic. What should I do</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.000" end="00:20:27.920" style="s2">to make that man like it?</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.200" end="00:20:30.920" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.560" end="00:20:52.159" style="s2">Is she insane? Sir never eats outside of mealtimes.</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.160" end="00:20:55.280" style="s2">That little cutie is definitely getting dragged out.</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.520" end="00:20:58.520" style="s2">Sir, would you like something to eat?</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.760" end="00:21:01.639" style="s2">What&#39;s that smell? Actually kinda good.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.640" end="00:21:02.600" style="s2">We&#39;re in business.</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.640" end="00:21:08.000" style="s2">Sir, this is a local specialty from my hometown — McDonald&#39;s fries.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.600" end="00:21:13.880" style="s2">Junk food. She&#39;s really got a death wish.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.440" end="00:21:18.799" style="s2">Guess I was overthinking. Sir hates this stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.800" end="00:21:22.880" style="s2">Unhealthy food. No way the mind-reading ability is on her.</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.480" end="00:21:26.599" style="s2">YuYang, what are you doing? Sir&#39;s noble stomach—</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.600" end="00:21:28.760" style="s2">how dare this junk food desecrate it?</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.920" end="00:21:40.999" style="s2">Holy crap, this is so good. This XiaoYunYang—</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.000" end="00:21:42.320" style="s2">actually has something going on.</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.040" end="00:21:45.920" style="s2">Yes! My gold bars are secured.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.240" end="00:21:49.879" style="s2">No—impossible. Sir has maintained for over a decade—</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.880" end="00:21:51.560" style="s2">How on earth did she bewitch him?</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.840" end="00:21:54.440" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.160" end="00:21:55.880" style="s2">I have to hold back.</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.600" end="00:21:59.240" style="s2">It&#39;s just a potato. I can&#39;t be this undisciplined.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.680" end="00:22:04.280" style="s2">What if—what if it were fried chicken dipped in this sauce?</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.120" end="00:22:06.320" style="s2">Wouldn&#39;t that be even better?</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.040" end="00:22:10.040" style="s2">No, I can&#39;t eat anymore. I have to resist.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.000" end="00:22:16.279" style="s2">Wait, bro, why are you leaving?</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.280" end="00:22:19.759" style="s2">Did you forget something? Three gold bars!</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.760" end="00:22:21.920" style="s2">You were eating pretty happily just now, weren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.240" end="00:22:26.119" style="s2">Fu the Skinflint—even Zhou the Skinflint would weep at your grave.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.120" end="00:22:28.399" style="s2">All that big talk, and you can&#39;t even spare three gold bars.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.400" end="00:22:31.760" style="s2">Iron Rooster. Scrooge reincarnated.</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.800" end="00:22:34.520" style="s2">YuYang.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.720" end="00:22:44.600" style="s2">Sister An, how do you walk with no sound? You scared me. What&#39;s up?</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.280" end="00:22:47.480" style="s2">How did you know</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.200" end="00:22:49.760" style="s2">that Sir wanted to eat this?</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.680" end="00:22:55.280" style="s2">System, immediate assessment—is the mind-reading ability on her?</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.520" end="00:22:58.519" style="s2">Host, you only get one assessment chance. If you guess wrong,</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.520" end="00:23:01.280" style="s2">Host will be eliminated. Are you sure you want to use it now?</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.400" end="00:23:07.040" style="s2">Why does her stare give me the creeps?</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.240" end="00:23:11.839" style="s2">Sister An, I just noticed Sir didn&#39;t eat much at lunch,</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.840" end="00:23:16.280" style="s2">figured he&#39;d be starving by afternoon, so I took a wild guess.</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.480" end="00:23:22.160" style="s2">I see. Next time don&#39;t act on your own. The Ravencrest Rules</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.640" end="00:23:23.599" style="s2">are not a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.600" end="00:23:26.599" style="s2">Yes, yes, Sister An is right. Let me take this plate</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.600" end="00:23:27.440" style="s2">to the kitchen now.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.640" end="00:23:31.279" style="s2">The mind-reading ability is my last ace in the hole.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.280" end="00:23:33.440" style="s2">No one can ever find out.</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.240" end="00:23:39.319" style="s2">Only one chance. Must be a hundred percent certain, Host.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.320" end="00:23:40.879" style="s2">Detected important plot point.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.880" end="00:23:42.680" style="s2">FuXiaoTing will be in danger in the storage room tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.040" end="00:23:46.519" style="s2">As long as you show up when the power cuts out and save the hero,</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.520" end="00:23:48.800" style="s2">his affection level will skyrocket.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.720" end="00:23:53.359" style="s2">This time, I&#39;m definitely going to</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.360" end="00:23:54.680" style="s2">nail FuXiaoTing in one shot.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.360" end="00:24:05.480" style="s2">YuYang, a new batch of ingredients just arrived at the storage room.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.840" end="00:24:09.920" style="s2">Go count them. One mistake and I&#39;m docking a month&#39;s pay.</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.600" end="00:24:15.560" style="s2">Butler Ju, it&#39;s almost mealtime. How about—</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.080" end="00:24:18.800" style="s2">Any objections?</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.360" end="00:24:23.360" style="s2">No, Butler Ju. Don&#39;t worry, I guarantee</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.480" end="00:24:25.760" style="s2">I&#39;ll count every single item crystal clear.</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.600" end="00:24:34.640" style="s2">Ji-ge, big deal, you&#39;ve got a lousy gun.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.760" end="00:24:37.280" style="s2">Once I&#39;m rich, I&#39;ll buy a 98K and blow your head off sooner or later.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.560" end="00:24:42.679" style="s2">All this food, and I&#39;m starving tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.680" end="00:24:44.240" style="s2">I can&#39;t even decide what to order.</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.560" end="00:24:48.440" style="s2">Wait, no—perfect chance to swipe some stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.560" end="00:24:50.240" style="s2">I can use it when I make a run for it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.320" end="00:24:56.239" style="s2">The wiring&#39;s old, they&#39;re doing maintenance—power&#39;s gonna cut out soon.</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.240" end="00:24:57.200" style="s2">Remember to come out early.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.320" end="00:24:58.040" style="s2">Thanks, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.400" end="00:25:28.520" style="s2">Fu the skinflint, still eating &#39;82 caviar.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.680" end="00:25:40.280" style="s2">Cordyceps—perfect, handy for when I bolt.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.480" end="00:25:45.320" style="s2">Power&#39;s out.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.160" end="00:25:48.560" style="s2">Perfect, easier to grab stuff in the dark.</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.360" end="00:25:52.880" style="s2">The moment&#39;s almost here. I&#39;m coming, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.920" end="00:25:56.360" style="s2">Why is it locked?</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.560" end="00:25:59.719" style="s2">Too bad, XiaoYunYang.</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.720" end="00:26:00.800" style="s2">You can&#39;t run now.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.040" end="00:26:07.400" style="s2">That&#39;s Fu Tingxiao&#39;s voice.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.520" end="00:26:38.840" style="s2">Holy crap, how did I end up kissing this guy? Gross, gross!</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.080" end="00:26:42.440" style="s2">This woman—she dared steal my first kiss.</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.760" end="00:26:47.479" style="s2">Sir, I swear, it was an accident! If I did it on purpose,</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.480" end="00:26:49.400" style="s2">I—I&#39;ll never make a dime my whole life.</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.240" end="00:26:51.200" style="s2">An accident?</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.920" end="00:26:54.320" style="s2">Then let her see what a real accident feels like.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.160" end="00:26:56.480" style="s2">What&#39;s he trying to do?</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.040" end="00:26:58.880" style="s2">AnJing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.840" end="00:27:00.680" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.800" end="00:27:02.120" style="s2">Sir&#39;s locked inside.</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.360" end="00:27:03.200" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.400" end="00:27:05.000" style="s2">Sir!</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.800" end="00:27:09.679" style="s2">Damn it, the System says the power cuts at 21:00.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.680" end="00:27:11.960" style="s2">Only one minute left—I have to show up then.</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.560" end="00:27:13.640" style="s2">Go get the repairman, quick!</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.600" end="00:27:16.040" style="s2">Sir, can you hear me?</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.240" end="00:27:21.080" style="s2">Should I snap her wrist first, or break her legs?</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.680" end="00:27:24.440" style="s2">Forget it—ripping her head off is cleaner.</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.920" end="00:27:28.400" style="s2">It&#39;s over, it&#39;s over—this psycho actually wants me dead.</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.000" end="00:27:33.920" style="s2">Three years either way. Might as well go all in.</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.480" end="00:27:38.000" style="s2">If I beat him into a cutie pie, I&#39;ll be safe.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.640" end="00:27:48.200" style="s2">I hit him. Wait, don&#39;t tell me I actually killed him?</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.400" end="00:27:53.240" style="s2">What the hell is going on?</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.480" end="00:27:59.000" style="s2">Sir, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.600" end="00:28:02.600" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me he got food poisoning from those fries I made?</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.840" end="00:28:03.560" style="s2">My stomach hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.960" end="00:28:40.280" style="s2">Something&#39;s off with him.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.240" end="00:28:42.800" style="s2">Whatever. I&#39;m outta here.</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.480" end="00:28:49.160" style="s2">Wait, don&#39;t tell me this big shot is afraid of the dark?</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.760" end="00:28:54.680" style="s2">Sir, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.560" end="00:28:58.160" style="s2">Don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.440" end="00:29:01.760" style="s2">Okay, okay, okay, I won&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.840" end="00:29:04.880" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t leave even if I wanted to, man.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.920" end="00:29:07.400" style="s2">Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.120" end="00:29:09.920" style="s2">Can you loosen your grip a little?</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.200" end="00:29:16.879" style="s2">Whatever. Consider it good karma. It&#39;s nothing, it&#39;s just—</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.880" end="00:29:18.200" style="s2">The lights just went out, that&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.280" end="00:29:20.120" style="s2">Don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.560" end="00:29:23.000" style="s2">Okay, okay, okay, I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.200" end="00:29:28.520" style="s2">Wait. Why is this inner voice clearer than before?</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.120" end="00:29:30.440" style="s2">Don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.880" end="00:29:36.920" style="s2">Wait—that wasn&#39;t an inner voice. This man can actually talk?</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.600" end="00:29:39.080" style="s2">Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.960" end="00:29:42.560" style="s2">YuYang.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.280" end="00:29:44.120" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.280" end="00:29:49.880" style="s2">Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.480" end="00:29:52.400" style="s2">Just hold on a little longer. The doctor&#39;s on the way.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.120" end="00:29:56.840" style="s2">What&#39;s going on? Wasn&#39;t he afraid of the dark? Why does his stomach hurt now?</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.320" end="00:29:58.640" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me it really is food poisoning?</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.480" end="00:30:00.200" style="s2">YuYang.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.800" end="00:30:03.920" style="s2">What are you doing in the storage room? What did you do to Sir?</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.400" end="00:30:05.960" style="s2">Sister An, you&#39;ve got me all wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.400" end="00:30:10.159" style="s2">It was Butler Ji. He told me to organize the inventory.</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.160" end="00:30:12.800" style="s2">I&#39;m just a worker. Sir suddenly got sick—</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.920" end="00:30:14.000" style="s2">It&#39;s got nothing to do with me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.760" end="00:30:19.399" style="s2">This XiaoYunYang is a total liar.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.400" end="00:30:22.999" style="s2">Stealing, kissing, knows my secret.</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.000" end="00:30:25.879" style="s2">When I&#39;m well, I&#39;ll feed her to wolves.</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.880" end="00:30:30.440" style="s2">Wolves again! Are you the Wolf King?</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.520" end="00:30:32.120" style="s2">Don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.440" end="00:30:37.040" style="s2">But he can clearly speak—why on earth would he pretend to be mute?</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.800" end="00:30:42.919" style="s2">Car crash on the bridge. Doctor&#39;s half hour away.</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.920" end="00:30:44.360" style="s2">Even at top speed, it&#39;ll take half an hour.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.720" end="00:30:45.440" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.760" end="00:30:48.320" style="s2">Sir can&#39;t wait that long.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.160" end="00:30:52.879" style="s2">Half an hour. If he croaks, the stealing...</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.880" end="00:30:57.559" style="s2">Just leaves no evidence at all. Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.560" end="00:31:01.040" style="s2">This woman—she&#39;s actually smirking.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.080" end="00:31:05.360" style="s2">Host, quick, tell him you have a way to ease the pain.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.440" end="00:31:08.839" style="s2">The System will provide you with temporary medical guidance.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.840" end="00:31:11.239" style="s2">This is the critical moment to boost your affection level.</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.240" end="00:31:13.280" style="s2">Sir, I&#39;ve learned some first-aid knowledge.</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.000" end="00:31:16.400" style="s2">Perhaps... I could...</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.000" end="00:31:18.440" style="s2">Yes, sir is wise.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.040" end="00:31:29.480" style="s2">YuYang, your resume says you graduated from medical school.</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.080" end="00:31:31.519" style="s2">You&#39;re the most skilled medical professional here.</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.520" end="00:31:33.920" style="s2">So you will diagnose and treat sir.</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.280" end="00:31:35.960" style="s2">Med school was the host&#39;s. I just took electives.</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.200" end="00:31:40.399" style="s2">On postpartum care for sows. Ji-ge—no, Butler Ji...</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.400" end="00:31:45.320" style="s2">Haven&#39;t used medical skills in ages. Now I&#39;m...</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.440" end="00:31:48.199" style="s2">Very rusty.</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.200" end="00:31:49.519" style="s2">Cure him, big reward. Fail, and...</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.520" end="00:31:54.560" style="s2">You&#39;ll be buried with sir.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.160" end="00:31:56.480" style="s2">Alright... I&#39;ll give it a try.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.520" end="00:32:06.560" style="s2">Screw it. I&#39;ll just treat this man like a live pig.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.360" end="00:32:11.600" style="s2">Forget it, treat him like a pig.</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.040" end="00:32:23.000" style="s2">Postpartum care for sows, Lesson One: palpation.</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.080" end="00:32:29.840" style="s2">Strange, Fu. It&#39;s been ages. What is she hesitating about?</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.200" end="00:32:32.120" style="s2">Sir, forgive my intrusion.</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.880" end="00:32:37.880" style="s2">Damn, this bastard&#39;s body is seriously stacked.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.080" end="00:32:42.080" style="s2">This XiaoYunYang is out of her damn mind.</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.680" end="00:32:44.240" style="s2">YuYang, what are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.760" end="00:32:50.000" style="s2">Butler Ji, through the clothes it&#39;ll affect the palpation assessment.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.360" end="00:32:51.680" style="s2">I&#39;m doing this for Sir&#39;s sake too.</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.880" end="00:32:54.920" style="s2">Sir, just relax a little.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.440" end="00:33:08.600" style="s2">Her lips... they&#39;re pretty soft.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.320" end="00:33:15.199" style="s2">Why did she suddenly get so scared? Did she hear something?</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.200" end="00:33:15.920" style="s2">Something she shouldn&#39;t have.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.520" end="00:33:18.800" style="s2">You, San, how dare you plot against Sir!</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.040" end="00:33:19.760" style="s2">I didn&#39;t!</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.920" end="00:33:24.080" style="s2">This is it. I felt it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.520" end="00:33:26.240" style="s2">Felt what?</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.560" end="00:33:29.000" style="s2">Sir, there&#39;s something in his stomach.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.240" end="00:33:32.599" style="s2">Warning! Warning! Hostile energy approaching!</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.600" end="00:33:33.439" style="s2">The mole is going to take advantage—</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.440" end="00:33:35.839" style="s2">—to strike at FuXiaoTing! Full estate on alert!</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.840" end="00:33:36.320" style="s2">Assassin!</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.600" end="00:33:40.400" style="s2">What&#39;s going on? Where&#39;s the assassin?</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.240" end="00:33:45.920" style="s2">Sorry, I&#39;m a mole. I can&#39;t let you save him.</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.080" end="00:33:48.680" style="s2">No—</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.640" end="00:33:51.320" style="s2">You should be stabbing him!</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.800" end="00:33:52.640" style="s2">Seize her!</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.960" end="00:33:58.759" style="s2">YuYang, hang in there!</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.760" end="00:34:01.520" style="s2">What exactly is inside Sir&#39;s stomach? Is it a tumor?</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.320" end="00:34:04.160" style="s2">Just tell us already!</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.000" end="00:34:06.080" style="s2">Inside his stomach—</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.240" end="00:34:09.919" style="s2">This XiaoYunYang is willing to risk her life for me...</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.920" end="00:34:11.840" style="s2">Could it be... she&#39;s already fallen for me?</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.000" end="00:34:19.759" style="s2">Doctor, treat Sir first. Just now YuYang said</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.760" end="00:34:20.960" style="s2">there&#39;s something inside Sir&#39;s stomach.</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.600" end="00:34:42.439" style="s2">Abdominal scan shows a semi-solid suspension.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.440" end="00:34:46.400" style="s2">composed of a hydrated cellulose matrix within Sir&#39;s abdominal cavity.</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.520" end="00:34:50.359" style="s2">Within it, approximately 3.8×10^13</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.360" end="00:34:53.360" style="s2">Microbes are fermenting and oxidizing.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.960" end="00:34:57.200" style="s2">Speak English! What exactly is in Sir&#39;s stomach? Is it—</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.560" end="00:35:01.760" style="s2">Shit.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.840" end="00:35:12.560" style="s2">Sir, the doctor says you just ate too much and have indigestion.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.160" end="00:35:15.320" style="s2">Are you feeling better now, Sir?</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.160" end="00:35:18.560" style="s2">In the storage room, a sack full of ingredients was found.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.920" end="00:35:20.120" style="s2">This must have been stolen by YuYang.</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.160" end="00:35:24.679" style="s2">Making junk food... picking the smallest fruits.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.680" end="00:35:27.679" style="s2">Sir suddenly pointed at her for treatment... too many coincidences.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.680" end="00:35:31.159" style="s2">The mind-reading ability is most likely on her, Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.160" end="00:35:32.480" style="s2">This YuYang dared to steal!</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.840" end="00:35:33.800" style="s2">We absolutely can&#39;t let this slide.</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.400" end="00:35:44.960" style="s2">How do you think we should deal with her?</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.640" end="00:35:49.999" style="s2">Sir, Ravencrest Rules say stealing—</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.000" end="00:35:53.599" style="s2">Hands severed, immediate expulsion.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.600" end="00:35:55.520" style="s2">She shall never set foot in Ravencrest Estate again.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.880" end="00:36:02.480" style="s2">Oh my God, YuYang, you&#39;re really going all out!</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.720" end="00:36:04.760" style="s2">Risking your life for a paycheck!</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.880" end="00:36:07.760" style="s2">You actually dared to take a knife for Sir! I heard</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.120" end="00:36:10.399" style="s2">the way Sir looked at her back then was... different.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.400" end="00:36:11.720" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me you planned this all along?</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.200" end="00:36:13.880" style="s2">What plan could I possibly have?</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.480" end="00:36:17.120" style="s2">It&#39;s all that undercover agent&#39;s fault—bad eyesight.</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.040" end="00:36:19.880" style="s2">But I heard—</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.480" end="00:36:23.119" style="s2">Butler Ju found a big sack in the storage room.</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.120" end="00:36:26.600" style="s2">The things she stole—top-tier ingredients, worth a fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.080" end="00:36:28.760" style="s2">She dared to steal from Ravencrest Estate!</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.360" end="00:36:32.359" style="s2">Forget taking one knife—take ten knives and you&#39;re still dead meat.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.360" end="00:36:34.039" style="s2">Stealing is the least of her problems.</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.040" end="00:36:35.119" style="s2">I know—FuXiaoTing.</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.120" end="00:36:36.799" style="s2">Playing dumb... this bastard definitely—</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.800" end="00:36:38.599" style="s2">He&#39;s definitely going to shut me up for good!</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.600" end="00:36:42.920" style="s2">Yeah, Huiyang, just you wait. Maybe tonight—</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.400" end="00:36:44.720" style="s2">By order of Sir—</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.880" end="00:36:49.039" style="s2">Oh no, they found out about the theft.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.040" end="00:36:51.799" style="s2">Chop my hand or feed me to wolves? Too late to faint?</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.800" end="00:36:53.959" style="s2">Here to deliver a gift to YuYang.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.960" end="00:36:55.400" style="s2">A gift?</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.040" end="00:37:06.680" style="s2">I was ordered to set this up. Really chop my hand off?</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.600" end="00:37:10.640" style="s2">N-no, I wouldn&#39;t dare, Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.480" end="00:37:15.920" style="s2">Just following rules. My mistake. Please forgive me, Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.120" end="00:37:19.519" style="s2">Sir actually bailed her out personally. This YuYang...</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.520" end="00:37:21.440" style="s2">Could she really have caught Sir&#39;s attention?</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.160" end="00:37:25.040" style="s2">Oh my God, Sir has never given a maid a gift before!</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.280" end="00:37:27.679" style="s2">Whatever&#39;s in there must be incredibly valuable!</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.680" end="00:37:30.799" style="s2">Fu the Skinflint changed? Because I took that blade for him?</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.800" end="00:37:33.560" style="s2">Could it be a box of gold bars? Or diamonds?</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.800" end="00:37:34.640" style="s2">A reward from Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.480" end="00:37:35.840" style="s2">Open it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.200" end="00:37:47.600" style="s2">Long johns. Arctic-brand.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.800" end="00:37:51.559" style="s2">I took a knife for Fu the Skinflint and he gives me a pair of...</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.560" end="00:37:52.880" style="s2">Twenty-buck free-shipping long johns.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.120" end="00:37:56.839" style="s2">Very... very practical, Host. Good omen.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.840" end="00:37:58.279" style="s2">FuXiaoTing gave her long johns.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.280" end="00:38:01.279" style="s2">He&#39;s humiliating her, saying she deserves cheap trash.</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.280" end="00:38:04.159" style="s2">Putting her in her place. Looks like the mind-reading ability...</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.160" end="00:38:06.799" style="s2">Might not be on her after all. But I can&#39;t let my guard down.</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.800" end="00:38:08.960" style="s2">I must put her at the top of my watch list.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.680" end="00:38:12.200" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong? Don&#39;t like the gift Sir gave you?</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.000" end="00:38:18.440" style="s2">Not at all! Who says these long johns are bad? They&#39;re amazing!</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.160" end="00:38:22.280" style="s2">This fabric, this craftsmanship, this warm cozy feeling!</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.880" end="00:38:25.280" style="s2">This is the pyramid of all long johns!</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.400" end="00:38:29.720" style="s2">The Oscars of gift-giving! I&#39;m truly so grateful to Sir!</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.240" end="00:38:35.840" style="s2">As long as you understand Sir&#39;s intentions. Rest and heal.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.680" end="00:38:37.280" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.960" end="00:38:50.600" style="s2">Sir, the gift has been delivered to YuYang.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.880" end="00:38:57.200" style="s2">Why care so much for a maid, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.560" end="00:39:01.280" style="s2">You have no shortage of money or precious items.</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.520" end="00:39:04.399" style="s2">Yet you went out of your way to send such a warm</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.400" end="00:39:05.480" style="s2">and unique gift.</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.200" end="00:39:07.520" style="s2">Consider it thanks to XiaoYunYang</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.880" end="00:39:11.239" style="s2">for taking a knife for me. Just give her a little taste of sweetness.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.240" end="00:39:14.360" style="s2">She knew I faked mute and kissed me!</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.080" end="00:39:18.440" style="s2">There&#39;ll be plenty of chances to torment her later.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.400" end="00:39:22.879" style="s2">FuXiaoTing, you cheap bastard, you ruthless skinflint.</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.880" end="00:39:26.120" style="s2">I hope you&#39;re constipated every day and eat salad every meal.</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.640" end="00:39:33.080" style="s2">So cold tonight. Better than nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.200" end="00:39:42.920" style="s2">Gold bars. Six of them. Sweet mother of God, I&#39;m rich!</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.320" end="00:39:50.719" style="s2">It&#39;s been a week and the wound still hasn&#39;t healed.</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.720" end="00:39:52.159" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me XiaoYunYang is</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.160" end="00:39:53.360" style="s2">taking advantage of this to slack off.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.960" end="00:39:56.720" style="s2">If she doesn&#39;t show up soon, I&#39;m docking her entire month&#39;s pay.</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.080" end="00:40:04.279" style="s2">My blissful recovery time is over. Back to being a beast of burden.</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.280" end="00:40:07.519" style="s2">Having to listen to this bastard ramble on. But for six gold bars,</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.520" end="00:40:08.240" style="s2">I guess I can grit my teeth and bear it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.560" end="00:40:13.760" style="s2">So dopey. Really like a dizzy little sheep.</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.440" end="00:40:22.520" style="s2">No way, am I seeing things? This bastard can actually smile?</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.240" end="00:40:33.079" style="s2">Sir, we just got word. Third Uncle and Fifth Uncle have joined forces</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.080" end="00:40:35.239" style="s2">and swallowed up several of our properties in the South District</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.240" end="00:40:36.200" style="s2">and the dock business.</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.440" end="00:40:43.040" style="s2">They&#39;ve sent wave after wave of assassins and they&#39;re still at it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.760" end="00:40:47.000" style="s2">Third and Fifth Uncle, those bastards.</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.480" end="00:40:48.559" style="s2">So the assassins from before</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.560" end="00:40:50.360" style="s2">were sent by FuXiaoTing&#39;s uncles.</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.960" end="00:40:54.200" style="s2">Rich families run deep. Even uncles betray you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.160" end="00:40:57.439" style="s2">Is he faking being mute just to</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.440" end="00:40:59.239" style="s2">lower his relatives&#39; guard?</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.240" end="00:41:01.279" style="s2">Also, Miss ShenMingYue has arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:41:01.280" end="00:41:02.840" style="s2">She&#39;s waiting in the living room.</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.920" end="00:41:06.680" style="s2">ShenMingYue. The female lead of the novel.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.640" end="00:41:11.359" style="s2">Auntie, don&#39;t expect me to build any kind of relationship with him.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.360" end="00:41:13.279" style="s2">He&#39;s a mute who can&#39;t even talk.</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.280" end="00:41:16.280" style="s2">It&#39;s like playing a lute to a cow. Hang up, hang up.</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.360" end="00:41:23.480" style="s2">Miss Shen, Sir is busy right now. If you have any requests,</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.960" end="00:41:24.800" style="s2">just let us know.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.320" end="00:41:28.879" style="s2">I remember it was written in the book—</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.880" end="00:41:31.639" style="s2">ShenMingYue is a conglomerate heiress.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.640" end="00:41:32.359" style="s2">And in the end, she almost</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.360" end="00:41:34.159" style="s2">got engaged to FuXiaoTing.</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.160" end="00:41:35.239" style="s2">If she could hurry up</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.240" end="00:41:37.879" style="s2">and capture FuXiaoTing, finish the plot,</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.880" end="00:41:39.920" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t I be able to go home?</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.160" end="00:41:43.279" style="s2">Host, this ShenMingYue has money and power.</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.280" end="00:41:45.080" style="s2">Getting close to her would be hugely beneficial to you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.120" end="00:41:49.040" style="s2">Miss Shen, welcome to Ravencrest Estate.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.400" end="00:41:52.280" style="s2">I&#39;m Head Maid AnJing. I&#39;ve prepared tea and refreshments for you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.880" end="00:41:53.600" style="s2">Just leave it there.</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.040" end="00:41:56.480" style="s2">Who&#39;s YuYang?</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.720" end="00:42:01.879" style="s2">What the hell? The heiress just got here</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.880" end="00:42:03.560" style="s2">and she&#39;s already got her sights on me, a lowly cannon fodder?</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.880" end="00:42:09.680" style="s2">Hello, Miss Shen. I&#39;m—</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.160" end="00:42:12.800" style="s2">I heard Ravencrest Estate got a maid with decent cooking skills. That&#39;s you, right?</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.280" end="00:42:14.120" style="s2">Go make me something good to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.400" end="00:42:20.240" style="s2">Hurry up, I&#39;m starving. Do a good job and you&#39;ll be rewarded.</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.440" end="00:42:22.280" style="s2">What are you waiting for? Go!</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.080" end="00:42:24.560" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.520" end="00:42:31.519" style="s2">This eldest Miss of the Shen family is notoriously impossible to serve.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.520" end="00:42:35.239" style="s2">She&#39;s driven away over thirty maids. I wanna see</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.240" end="00:42:36.560" style="s2">how you&#39;re gonna walk right into the line of fire.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.440" end="00:42:45.439" style="s2">What the hell is this? Why does it smell so gross?</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.440" end="00:42:47.120" style="s2">Why does it smell like crap?</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.120" end="00:42:53.360" style="s2">No class at all. This is authentic Liuzhou snail rice noodles.</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.440" end="00:43:00.679" style="s2">This heiress grew up eating delicacies from land and sea.</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.680" end="00:43:03.680" style="s2">Fobbing her off with a bowl of pig slop? You&#39;re asking for death.</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.360" end="00:43:12.680" style="s2">This sour and stinky goodness hits just right.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.920" end="00:43:26.240" style="s2">Little maid, this is for you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.200" end="00:43:28.400" style="s2">Thank you, Miss Shen.</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.680" end="00:43:38.479" style="s2">This XiaoYunYang</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.920" end="00:43:42.080" style="s2">Dares to cook for others and even accept their gifts.</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.200" end="00:43:54.680" style="s2">Sir, this is a Rolex worth over a thousand squares.</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.800" end="00:43:56.000" style="s2">How can you just give it to her?</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.160" end="00:44:04.160" style="s2">Sir, what do you want to eat? This old servant will make it for you right now.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.520" end="00:44:05.120" style="s2">Little maid</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.880" end="00:44:09.800" style="s2">FuXiaoTing, this little maid</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.920" end="00:44:11.120" style="s2">From now on, she&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.320" end="00:44:50.960" style="s2">I&#39;m rich! Filthy rich!</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.520" end="00:44:54.800" style="s2">She got lucky again, that lucky bitch.</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.880" end="00:45:09.320" style="s2">The Master gave this to you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.320" end="00:45:18.920" style="s2">Ten o&#39;clock, go to his room. It&#39;s not gonna be that kind of reward, is it?</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.120" end="00:45:30.199" style="s2">What if it really is a more valuable reward? Like...</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.200" end="00:45:31.160" style="s2">A box of gold bars!</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.480" end="00:45:34.640" style="s2">Fortune favors the bold.</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.280" end="00:45:40.760" style="s2">Anyway, if things go south, I&#39;m bolting.</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.840" end="00:45:46.520" style="s2">Sneaking out this late</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.120" end="00:45:48.680" style="s2">And heading toward the main building</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.120" end="00:45:51.680" style="s2">Something&#39;s definitely off.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.160" end="00:46:02.120" style="s2">Just as I thought.</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.960" end="00:46:04.760" style="s2">She actually dared to go to the Master&#39;s room.</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.960" end="00:46:09.440" style="s2">External attack detected! Host, Host, wake up!</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.520" end="00:46:24.080" style="s2">Sir, why are you here?</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.720" end="00:46:39.080" style="s2">Sir, may I ask what the reward is?</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.400" end="00:46:43.640" style="s2">In the storage room. You heard me speak, didn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.960" end="00:46:48.680" style="s2">Oh no. The reward isn&#39;t gonna be silencing me forever, is it?</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.880" end="00:46:52.999" style="s2">Sir, don&#39;t worry. I&#39;ve been tight-lipped since I was a kid.</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.000" end="00:46:54.560" style="s2">Not a peep ever slips out.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.240" end="00:46:57.920" style="s2">Go cook. Now.</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.520" end="00:47:02.840" style="s2">Only I get to eat it. If it&#39;s good, I&#39;ll let you live.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.320" end="00:47:05.000" style="s2">If it&#39;s not good...</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.440" end="00:47:08.960" style="s2">Sir, don&#39;t worry. I guarantee you&#39;ll be satisfied.</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.280" end="00:47:11.480" style="s2">Phew, thank God.</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.080" end="00:47:15.800" style="s2">Looks like I need to bust out my best skills. What should I make?</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.760" end="00:47:17.960" style="s2">Make duck.</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.280" end="00:47:20.480" style="s2">Duck?</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.040" end="00:47:22.760" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.360" end="00:47:57.440" style="s2">What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.920" end="00:48:01.040" style="s2">Sir, this is a specialty from my hometown—Peking Duck.</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.760" end="00:48:05.360" style="s2">Peking?</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.200" end="00:48:07.520" style="s2">Country S has a place like that?</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.680" end="00:48:12.080" style="s2">Oh no, I forgot this is a novel world.</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.800" end="00:48:15.440" style="s2">Sir, my family... we&#39;re from the countryside.</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.560" end="00:48:17.360" style="s2">I&#39;m sure you&#39;ve never heard of it, Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.160" end="00:48:30.560" style="s2">Sir, you roll it up like this—it&#39;s so good.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.120" end="00:48:43.160" style="s2">This flavor...</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.440" end="00:48:47.960" style="s2">How is it, Sir? Good?</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.520" end="00:48:50.840" style="s2">I suppose it&#39;s passable.</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.080" end="00:48:55.760" style="s2">Delicious! So delicious!</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.680" end="00:49:05.239" style="s2">This XiaoYunYang—</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.240" end="00:49:07.160" style="s2">She actually looks really pretty when she smiles.</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.840" end="00:49:22.880" style="s2">Sorry, Sir! I—it was just reflex.</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.560" end="00:49:29.480" style="s2">This roast duck is actually decent.</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.320" end="00:49:31.040" style="s2">A reward for you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.000" end="00:49:43.639" style="s2">This bastard&#39;s necklace—how much must it be worth?</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.640" end="00:49:44.840" style="s2">He wouldn&#39;t even give it to me after all this time.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.280" end="00:49:47.480" style="s2">You may make one request.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.520" end="00:49:54.800" style="s2">Sir, since you said so, I&#39;ll be bold—I want...</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.040" end="00:49:57.559" style="s2">A promotion. To Head Butler. Ideally one that puts me above</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.560" end="00:50:00.080" style="s2">JuJiLuo and AnJing.</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.400" end="00:50:03.559" style="s2">Since I can&#39;t escape anytime soon, might as well</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.560" end="00:50:07.160" style="s2">flip the script—serf to butler. Gold&#39;s got nothing on power.</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.160" end="00:50:12.800" style="s2">Ambitious. Granted.</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.520" end="00:50:15.320" style="s2">Really? Thank you, Sir!</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.160" end="00:50:18.200" style="s2">Can I—can I make one more request?</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.920" end="00:50:20.840" style="s2">Could you get me a gun?</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.080" end="00:50:23.600" style="s2">That way, if anyone pisses me off in the future, I&#39;ll just point it</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.720" end="00:50:25.040" style="s2">right at their forehead.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.440" end="00:50:28.400" style="s2">Nine a.m. tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.000" end="00:50:31.040" style="s2">Back hill shooting range. I&#39;ll teach you how to shoot.</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.880" end="00:50:33.440" style="s2">Really? Thank you, Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.640" end="00:50:36.680" style="s2">Sir, could you put it in writing for me?</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.280" end="00:50:39.560" style="s2">Black and white. Nice and solid.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.560" end="00:51:23.719" style="s2">YuYang, what are you thinking about?</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.720" end="00:51:25.039" style="s2">FuXiaoTing is just a</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.040" end="00:51:26.840" style="s2">heartless, cold-blooded fictional character.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.680" end="00:51:30.319" style="s2">Your mission is to finish the plot and go home.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.320" end="00:51:33.320" style="s2">How could you get seduced by a pretty face? Go to sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.360" end="00:51:46.039" style="s2">Keep XiaoYunYang by my side at all times,</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.040" end="00:51:47.360" style="s2">cooking just for me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.200" end="00:51:49.640" style="s2">That actually doesn&#39;t sound half bad.</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.920" end="00:52:06.560" style="s2">Holy crap, why do I still get my period even inside a novel?</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.760" end="00:52:09.919" style="s2">System, how did I end up sleeping in the hallway?</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.920" end="00:52:11.000" style="s2">Did YuYang pull something?</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.720" end="00:52:13.999" style="s2">Host, vital signs indicate</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.000" end="00:52:17.480" style="s2">A small mark on your neck, but target unconfirmed.</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.920" end="00:52:24.680" style="s2">Morning meeting. You dare show up late?</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.640" end="00:52:29.960" style="s2">Rule: tardiness or slacking means no monthly bonus.</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.320" end="00:52:32.120" style="s2">plus you&#39;re punished with cleaning all the restrooms.</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.800" end="00:52:37.159" style="s2">Open your tiny little eyes and look carefully. Where&#39;s Sir?</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.160" end="00:52:39.319" style="s2">He&#39;s already given me permission to manage the kitchen</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.320" end="00:52:41.000" style="s2">and all the maids in the main building.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.320" end="00:52:44.360" style="s2">This place? It&#39;s all under my control now.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.800" end="00:52:49.039" style="s2">What exactly happened last night?</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.040" end="00:52:51.560" style="s2">Sir actually agreed to let her be the Head Maid?</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.160" end="00:52:55.640" style="s2">You think a flimsy piece of paper lets you boss me around?</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.120" end="00:52:58.040" style="s2">I&#39;ve been here for over a decade.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.280" end="00:53:02.240" style="s2">So, Butler Ju, does that mean you&#39;re questioning Sir&#39;s decision?</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.480" end="00:53:05.240" style="s2">How about we go ask Sir together?</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.160" end="00:53:15.680" style="s2">Girl, rules here are set in stone.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.400" end="00:53:25.519" style="s2">Sir actually got her a gun too, YuYang.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.520" end="00:53:26.480" style="s2">You&#39;ve got some serious nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.840" end="00:53:34.039" style="s2">Nobody move! This gun&#39;s brand new, and my hands are kinda rusty.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.040" end="00:53:38.000" style="s2">One little slip, one wrong twitch of the finger—</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.120" end="00:53:40.040" style="s2">and somebody&#39;s pretty little head gets blown off.</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.640" end="00:53:41.240" style="s2">I won&#39;t be held responsible.</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.080" end="00:53:45.319" style="s2">FuXiaoTing, truly generous. Giving me one—</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.320" end="00:53:48.920" style="s2">and a spare. This is my chance to rise up and sing freedom!</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.160" end="00:53:56.600" style="s2">Now that&#39;s more like it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.920" end="00:54:02.360" style="s2">Good dogs don&#39;t block the way.</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.280" end="00:54:09.560" style="s2">Now that I&#39;m officially the Head Butler—</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.800" end="00:54:13.640" style="s2">let me say a few words. First, this month—</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.760" end="00:54:16.640" style="s2">everyone gets a ten-thousand bonus. Cash.</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.040" end="00:54:23.480" style="s2">Who wants the boss&#39;s empty promises and BS?</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.600" end="00:54:26.600" style="s2">Shaking up the workplace—cold hard cash is what actually matters.</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.320" end="00:54:28.400" style="s2">Second—</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.360" end="00:54:30.320" style="s2">Meeting dismissed.</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.920" end="00:54:41.839" style="s2">Damn it, cramps are relentless. So being a big shot—</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.840" end="00:54:43.160" style="s2">really does come at a price.</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.760" end="00:54:44.840" style="s2">Butler Yun.</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.360" end="00:54:48.320" style="s2">You were amazing back there.</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.600" end="00:54:53.360" style="s2">This little wooden puppet I carved myself—it&#39;s for you.</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.720" end="00:54:54.560" style="s2">Congrats on the promotion.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.240" end="00:54:57.080" style="s2">Thanks.</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.960" end="00:55:02.960" style="s2">She sure smiles big for everyone else.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.040" end="00:55:04.880" style="s2">Butler Yun.</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.080" end="00:55:14.240" style="s2">Flinging cash around, huh? But according to the Ravencrest Rules—</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.600" end="00:55:16.160" style="s2">large disbursements—</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.760" end="00:55:18.560" style="s2">require Sir&#39;s personal signature.</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.280" end="00:55:23.000" style="s2">It&#39;s ten in the morning now. Before midnight tonight—</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.120" end="00:55:26.360" style="s2">if the money hasn&#39;t landed, guess what—</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.600" end="00:55:28.760" style="s2">those servants who got their hopes up for nothing—</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.480" end="00:55:31.520" style="s2">how do you think they&#39;ll treat their new Head Butler?</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.720" end="00:55:33.320" style="s2">Oh no.</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.040" end="00:55:38.359" style="s2">Forgot that showing off. If money doesn&#39;t come—</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.360" end="00:55:41.119" style="s2">those people will skin me alive.</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.120" end="00:55:44.960" style="s2">No need, Butler Ju. I&#39;ll get Sir&#39;s signature now.</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.160" end="00:55:57.080" style="s2">This is no ordinary period cramp</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.680" end="00:56:02.120" style="s2">It&#39;s like a construction crew is renovating inside my belly</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.040" end="00:56:10.880" style="s2">Sir</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.120" end="00:56:28.160" style="s2">Sir, you&#39;re busy</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.720" end="00:56:33.440" style="s2">Um, there&#39;s a document I&#39;d like you to sign</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.800" end="00:56:38.000" style="s2">What document</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.160" end="00:56:43.640" style="s2">It&#39;s about giving bonuses to the maids in the main building</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.760" end="00:56:45.920" style="s2">Ten thousand each, just a small thing</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.840" end="00:56:48.800" style="s2">Reason</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.040" end="00:56:51.920" style="s2">To boost morale, improve work efficiency, serve you better</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.080" end="00:56:54.920" style="s2">Is that so</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.600" end="00:57:00.560" style="s2">Not because you took someone&#39;s little gifts and want to buy loyalty</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.400" end="00:57:04.640" style="s2">How does he know a young hottie gave me something</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.480" end="00:57:08.600" style="s2">Does Ravencrest Estate have surveillance everywhere</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.800" end="00:57:17.000" style="s2">Ugh, I want sweet and sour pork ribs, no sugar, no ribs</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.200" end="00:57:20.600" style="s2">He wants sweet and sour pork ribs right now</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.640" end="00:57:27.920" style="s2">Um, sir, about the signing, I saw some</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.400" end="00:57:31.640" style="s2">fresh ribs in the kitchen, how about I make you</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.800" end="00:57:38.000" style="s2">YuYang</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.960" end="00:57:48.440" style="s2">Sir</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.400" end="00:57:52.999" style="s2">Don&#39;t move, the doctor isn&#39;t here yet, I just don&#39;t want you</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.000" end="00:57:55.280" style="s2">making a mess in my room</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.800" end="00:57:58.640" style="s2">Thank you</p>
<p begin="00:58:15.080" end="00:58:16.640" style="s2">This is for me</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.880" end="00:58:23.000" style="s2">From now on, only accept gifts from me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.120" end="00:58:24.320" style="s2">Anyone</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.160" end="00:58:29.960" style="s2">Yes! No gifts from anyone else!</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.920" end="00:58:36.680" style="s2">Just as I thought, a money-grubbing XiaoYunYang</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.640" end="00:58:40.519" style="s2">I was going to have her make barbecue today</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.520" end="00:58:43.400" style="s2">Seeing her half-dead like this, forget it</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.880" end="00:58:46.520" style="s2">Barbecue, sir, I&#39;m good at that</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.920" end="00:58:52.159" style="s2">Oh no, I—I just responded to him!</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.160" end="00:58:53.840" style="s2">Fu XiaoTing&#39;s inner thoughts</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.800" end="00:59:01.999" style="s2">Sir, do you want some barbecue too? I saw you just now—</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.000" end="00:59:05.359" style="s2">You eyed those gold bars like skewers.</p>
<p begin="00:59:05.360" end="00:59:08.360" style="s2">Telepathy. It&#39;s definitely telepathy.</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.800" end="00:59:11.720" style="s2">My stomach doesn&#39;t even hurt anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.560" end="00:59:22.280" style="s2">Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.880" end="00:59:23.720" style="s2">Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.040" end="00:59:37.400" style="s2">Is it a coincidence, or...</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.840" end="00:59:56.480" style="s2">Sir, tomorrow is the Madam&#39;s death anniversary.</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.320" end="01:00:00.080" style="s2">Our car and supplies are all ready.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.640" end="01:00:02.240" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.360" end="01:00:10.040" style="s2">Mom, why are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.000" end="01:00:13.400" style="s2">Wait for me—I&#39;ll get Dad to save you!</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.520" end="01:00:14.120" style="s2">Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.720" end="01:00:15.440" style="s2">XiaoTing</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.520" end="01:00:20.480" style="s2">Don&#39;t be fooled by your father like I was.</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.720" end="01:00:24.079" style="s2">In the end, I died with my eyes wide open. Stay away—</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.080" end="01:00:27.200" style="s2">From anyone who tries to capture you. You must kill them.</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.440" end="01:00:31.639" style="s2">Only a mind-reading captor can keep you alive.</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.640" end="01:00:32.960" style="s2">in this world.</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.600" end="01:00:36.200" style="s2">YuYang</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.640" end="01:00:39.560" style="s2">Will you be that person?</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.040" end="01:00:47.479" style="s2">Scared me! Almost blew my cover. Did he suspect?</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.480" end="01:00:51.080" style="s2">No, no, absolutely not. I can&#39;t respond to his inner thoughts again.</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.720" end="01:01:02.719" style="s2">Thank God. Looks like this slave-driver Fu didn&#39;t suspect a thing.</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.720" end="01:01:04.040" style="s2">He still signed off on the loan.</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.280" end="01:01:19.399" style="s2">Well, well, the little maid&#39;s here. What, a few meals got you</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.400" end="01:01:21.560" style="s2">close enough to touch a gun? You&#39;ve got some skills.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.520" end="01:01:24.799" style="s2">Miss Shen, you flatter me. Sir figured that now that I&#39;m the butler,</p>
<p begin="01:01:24.800" end="01:01:27.920" style="s2">I need some self-defense skills, so he had me come train.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.040" end="01:01:29.480" style="s2">Male-pleaser.</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.800" end="01:01:32.120" style="s2">Since your cooking&#39;s decent enough for my taste,</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.800" end="01:01:36.080" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you a friendly warning.</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.320" end="01:01:37.640" style="s2">That Fu XiaoTing guy—</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.240" end="01:01:39.080" style="s2">Looks all proper and polished on the outside,</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.200" end="01:01:40.160" style="s2">You look decent on the outside,</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.760" end="01:01:46.039" style="s2">What? FuXiaoTing is actually that brutal—to this</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.040" end="01:01:47.480" style="s2">extent?</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.480" end="01:01:53.600" style="s2">You little bunny, you&#39;d better not give your heart away, or</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.840" end="01:01:55.760" style="s2">you&#39;ll be left with nothing but bone fragments.</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.120" end="01:01:59.480" style="s2">Overthinking it, sis. I just want to hand over these cramps.</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.760" end="01:02:13.160" style="s2">Speak of the devil and he shows up with that sour face.</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.960" end="01:02:15.920" style="s2">So handsome though.</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.240" end="01:02:18.079" style="s2">Snap out of it, YuYang.</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.080" end="01:02:19.759" style="s2">No matter how hot FuXiaoTing is,</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.760" end="01:02:21.800" style="s2">he belongs to the heroine ShenMingYue.</p>
<p begin="01:02:26.240" end="01:02:30.680" style="s2">You&#39;re just a side character, showing off like a peacock—</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.560" end="01:02:37.039" style="s2">This XiaoYunYang, the moment I look away,</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.040" end="01:02:39.320" style="s2">he&#39;s already mixing with this brainless woman.</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.360" end="01:02:44.239" style="s2">This Miss High-and-Mighty, strutting around like she owns the place.</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.240" end="01:02:45.679" style="s2">When am I ever gonna</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.680" end="01:02:47.000" style="s2">capture FuXiaoTing?</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.840" end="01:02:50.960" style="s2">Did the plot shift just because I got transported into this novel?</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.680" end="01:02:55.280" style="s2">Sir.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.520" end="01:03:07.280" style="s2">What kind of teacher acts like this? Not a single word—</p>
<p begin="01:03:07.400" end="01:03:09.919" style="s2">just bam bam bam showing off like crazy. This is clearly a power move.</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.920" end="01:03:12.560" style="s2">As if one look from me is gonna turn me into a sharpshooter.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.440" end="01:03:30.920" style="s2">Little maid, here to learn shooting or wreck the place?</p>
<p begin="01:03:31.400" end="01:03:34.400" style="s2">The birds moved nests to the forest and still couldn&#39;t escape you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:37.640" end="01:03:39.440" style="s2">What are you chatting about? So happy.</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.360" end="01:03:44.000" style="s2">XiaoTing, MingYue didn&#39;t cause you any trouble, did she?</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.080" end="01:03:47.960" style="s2">This is FuXiaoTing&#39;s stepmother.</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.200" end="01:03:49.160" style="s2">SuWanQing.</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.000" end="01:03:53.359" style="s2">Auntie, what are you doing here? Of course I was worried about you—</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.360" end="01:03:55.400" style="s2">afraid you&#39;d be careless and cause trouble for XiaoTing.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.240" end="01:03:58.640" style="s2">XiaoTing, look at you, it&#39;s not convenient for you to speak.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.240" end="01:04:01.759" style="s2">Managing such a huge fortune, so exhausted every single day.</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.760" end="01:04:03.200" style="s2">Auntie&#39;s been worried sick.</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.000" end="01:04:06.680" style="s2">No wonder he plays mute.</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.280" end="01:04:10.639" style="s2">Every single one of them, eyeing his fortune. Don&#39;t you get tired</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.640" end="01:04:12.200" style="s2">talking in circles like that?</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.760" end="01:04:18.320" style="s2">You old witch, I&#39;d toss you to the North Pole to feed the bears.</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.800" end="01:04:24.799" style="s2">What are you laughing at? This is the new maid at Ravencrest Estate.</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.800" end="01:04:26.000" style="s2">So rude.</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.080" end="01:04:29.960" style="s2">Madam, I&#39;m just happy for Sir.</p>
<p begin="01:04:30.320" end="01:04:33.199" style="s2">Sir may not be able to speak, but he handles what needs handling.</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.200" end="01:04:36.200" style="s2">Rewards what deserves rewarding. He runs Ravencrest Estate like clockwork.</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.680" end="01:04:39.680" style="s2">We servants completely respect his discipline.</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.520" end="01:04:44.479" style="s2">And having a family member like you, Madam, who cares so much about Sir—</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.480" end="01:04:46.760" style="s2">Sir must feel so warm inside.</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.120" end="01:04:49.280" style="s2">Who the hell do you think you are? Someone get over here!</p>
<p begin="01:04:53.840" end="01:04:56.959" style="s2">Host, based on the original plot and probability calculations—</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.960" end="01:04:58.519" style="s2">a bullet will strike the male lead in a moment.</p>
<p begin="01:04:58.520" end="01:05:01.520" style="s2">This is the critical moment for you to take the bullet for him. You must seize it.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.840" end="01:05:05.000" style="s2">You little butler, you sure know how to talk.</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.600" end="01:05:22.880" style="s2">What kind of teaching stance is this?</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.600" end="01:05:24.320" style="s2">Lower your wrist.</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.040" end="01:05:25.640" style="s2">Three-point alignment.</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.160" end="01:05:31.760" style="s2">Hit!</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.480" end="01:05:33.800" style="s2">Sir, direct hit!</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.280" end="01:05:37.519" style="s2">Now, turn thirty degrees to the right and pull the trigger—</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.520" end="01:05:38.960" style="s2">and you can kill SuWanQing.</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.920" end="01:05:42.560" style="s2">He&#39;s testing me. He knows I can hear.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.120" end="01:05:44.720" style="s2">Sir...</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.560" end="01:05:49.640" style="s2">I-I&#39;ve never been this close to a man before. I&#39;m shy.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.120" end="01:05:56.000" style="s2">Auntie, I already told you—I don&#39;t like that mute.</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.840" end="01:06:00.320" style="s2">Like him or not, what matters is the Fu family fortune.</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.760" end="01:06:03.440" style="s2">You just want me to butter up that mute, don&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.280" end="01:06:05.240" style="s2">Fine. I&#39;ll do as you wish.</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.080" end="01:06:14.479" style="s2">Host, attention—bullet attack in five minutes.</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.480" end="01:06:19.160" style="s2">Get ready for your bullet-blocking performance. System, don&#39;t worry. This time—</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.520" end="01:06:20.359" style="s2">I will definitely become</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.360" end="01:06:22.160" style="s2">FuXiaoTing&#39;s savior.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.600" end="01:06:40.040" style="s2">FuXiaoTing, you&#39;re my god.</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.200" end="01:06:45.800" style="s2">You little wretch.</p>
<p begin="01:06:46.400" end="01:06:47.240" style="s2">What the hell is going on?</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.960" end="01:06:52.759" style="s2">No, I gotta get out of here fast.</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.760" end="01:06:54.199" style="s2">That little test FuXiaoTing pulled just now—</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.200" end="01:06:54.920" style="s2">That scared the hell out of me.</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.520" end="01:06:56.360" style="s2">You&#39;re not going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.880" end="01:07:01.040" style="s2">So, little maid? Am I warm enough for you?</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.360" end="01:07:05.240" style="s2">Miss Shen, you really are burning hot. Miss Shen.</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.480" end="01:07:08.120" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave you two to your... passion.</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.080" end="01:07:10.520" style="s2">XiaoYunYang—you dare run?</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.640" end="01:07:16.520" style="s2">Hands off, mute. This maid is under my protection.</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.360" end="01:07:19.279" style="s2">Host, only one minute left.</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.280" end="01:07:20.120" style="s2">Get ready.</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.160" end="01:07:30.920" style="s2">Someone&#39;s here! Sir, I&#39;ll protect you—Auntie!</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.240" end="01:07:38.840" style="s2">Not bad—did I plan that?</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.480" end="01:07:44.239" style="s2">Not bad at all, little maid. You actually saved this mute bastard&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.240" end="01:07:44.840" style="s2">miserable life.</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.080" end="01:07:53.719" style="s2">Host, key plot point failed again.</p>
<p begin="01:07:53.720" end="01:07:55.159" style="s2">Must confirm ASAP whether the mind-reading ability</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.160" end="01:07:57.800" style="s2">is on YuYang. No more screw-ups.</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.640" end="01:08:01.880" style="s2">YuYang. You again. Just you wait.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.960" end="01:08:14.840" style="s2">I received a report that YuYang is hiding contraband.</p>
<p begin="01:08:15.320" end="01:08:18.680" style="s2">What the hell? AnJing, I&#39;m the Head Butler now—</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.400" end="01:08:20.600" style="s2">What gives you the right to search my room?</p>
<p begin="01:08:31.640" end="01:08:34.640" style="s2">Just as suspected—large quantities of valuables with unknown origins.</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.480" end="01:08:38.239" style="s2">YuYang, as Head Butler you&#39;ve openly violated</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.240" end="01:08:41.719" style="s2">Rule Seven: immediate transfer.</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.720" end="01:08:44.599" style="s2">to scrub every single bathroom until</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.600" end="01:08:47.000" style="s2">the source of these gold bars is fully investigated.</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.200" end="01:08:52.280" style="s2">If you dare to resist</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.880" end="01:08:53.960" style="s2">you&#39;re out immediately</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.320" end="01:08:55.639" style="s2">You&#39;re framing me</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.600" end="01:09:01.160" style="s2">I&#39;m framing you? Where&#39;s your proof? Who saw it?</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.640" end="01:09:02.720" style="s2">Did Sir give these to you?</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.040" end="01:09:05.480" style="s2">Did any of you see that?</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.720" end="01:09:11.840" style="s2">You just wait, AnJing</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.480" end="01:09:20.240" style="s2">Tomorrow is Madam&#39;s death anniversary.</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.360" end="01:09:21.680" style="s2">Sir really takes it seriously every year</p>
<p begin="01:09:22.400" end="01:09:24.200" style="s2">Have you ever heard the rumors?</p>
<p begin="01:09:25.640" end="01:09:28.639" style="s2">They say the Madam went missing for months back then</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.640" end="01:09:31.640" style="s2">She died soon after they found her. Quiet down.</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.880" end="01:09:34.400" style="s2">I heard when the Madam went missing, the young master was still little</p>
<p begin="01:09:34.760" end="01:09:36.560" style="s2">After that, Sir never spoke again</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.280" end="01:09:39.560" style="s2">He used to be such a lively, cheerful young master</p>
<p begin="01:09:40.400" end="01:09:41.360" style="s2">What a tragedy</p>
<p begin="01:09:46.520" end="01:09:48.560" style="s2">A cheerful little boy</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.160" end="01:09:50.840" style="s2">A missing mother</p>
<p begin="01:09:52.040" end="01:09:54.200" style="s2">Traumatic mutism</p>
<p begin="01:09:56.600" end="01:09:57.200" style="s2">Don&#39;t go</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.960" end="01:10:03.799" style="s2">So that day in the storage room, he spoke in front of me</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.800" end="01:10:06.200" style="s2">because he was traumatized as a child</p>
<p begin="01:10:19.640" end="01:10:21.800" style="s2">YuYang, what are you looking at?</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.400" end="01:10:25.160" style="s2">Someone stuffed a note into the cleaning supplies they gave me</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.280" end="01:10:27.800" style="s2">I know you can hear me. Hear what?</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.400" end="01:10:32.000" style="s2">Hear me cursing about how filthy the toilet is? Weird</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.200" end="01:10:40.280" style="s2">Could it be</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.000" end="01:10:41.840" style="s2">I guessed wrong</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.040" end="01:10:44.720" style="s2">The mind-reading ability isn&#39;t on her</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.560" end="01:10:50.720" style="s2">Then who the hell wrote that note?</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.600" end="01:10:59.480" style="s2">Wait, could it be Fu XiaoTing...</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.960" end="01:11:01.760" style="s2">Did Fu XiaoTing find out?</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.960" end="01:11:03.920" style="s2">Ugh, reeks.</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.480" end="01:11:07.520" style="s2">All thanks to that nasty AnJing, making me scrub toilets.</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.080" end="01:11:11.840" style="s2">Tomorrow. The death anniversary.</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.280" end="01:11:14.600" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:11:31.640" end="01:11:34.400" style="s2">Trying to screw me over? Not a chance.</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.680" end="01:11:46.399" style="s2">He actually brought me out to a grave visit—perfect chance to bolt.</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.400" end="01:11:47.840" style="s2">I need to find a way to slip away.</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.520" end="01:11:50.960" style="s2">Man, this grabbed pancake is legit.</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.320" end="01:11:52.760" style="s2">It&#39;s hand-grabbed pancake.</p>
<p begin="01:11:53.000" end="01:11:53.960" style="s2">Whatever, same thing.</p>
<p begin="01:11:56.360" end="01:11:57.920" style="s2">Hey, little maid.</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.520" end="01:11:59.360" style="s2">You and—</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.080" end="01:12:01.639" style="s2">What exactly is your deal with Fu XiaoTing?</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.640" end="01:12:03.320" style="s2">He actually brought you to a grave visit.</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.840" end="01:12:15.080" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me you two—are you guys hooking up?</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.520" end="01:12:19.039" style="s2">Miss Shen, I fear no shattered bones.</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.040" end="01:12:22.400" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep my virtue clean for all the world to see. Mr. Fu and I—we have nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.880" end="01:12:23.960" style="s2">Nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.440" end="01:12:27.319" style="s2">Fair enough. Growing up, around him—</p>
<p begin="01:12:27.320" end="01:12:29.720" style="s2">Not even a single female mosquito. As if he&#39;d ever look at you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.080" end="01:12:40.160" style="s2">Sir!</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.680" end="01:13:15.559" style="s2">You&#39;ve all lost your dads and moms, not a one of you has a home.</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.560" end="01:13:21.440" style="s2">No friends or family to help you—scared of being all alone?</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.560" end="01:13:22.400" style="s2">AnJing!</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.120" end="01:13:25.400" style="s2">How dare you disrupt the ceremony on Madam&#39;s death anniversary!</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.360" end="01:13:29.120" style="s2">Butler Ju, someone absolutely messed with my phone!</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.240" end="01:13:32.000" style="s2">Effective immediately, AnJing is stripped of her Head Maid position.</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.240" end="01:13:33.320" style="s2">Three months&#39; salary revoked.</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.880" end="01:13:42.320" style="s2">YuYang, it has to be you. I&#39;m not done with you!</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.280" end="01:13:52.760" style="s2">Sir.</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.480" end="01:13:54.920" style="s2">The car for your return is ready.</p>
<p begin="01:13:59.120" end="01:14:01.399" style="s2">My apologies, Mrs. Fu. I meant no offense.</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.400" end="01:14:03.560" style="s2">It&#39;s also about punishing evil and rewarding good. Rest assured.</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.160" end="01:14:07.399" style="s2">As long as I&#39;m around, your son will be fed and treated like royalty.</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.400" end="01:14:09.080" style="s2">We&#39;ll fatten him up nice and plump.</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.200" end="01:14:19.760" style="s2">Anything else you need, Sir?</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.960" end="01:14:27.320" style="s2">Butler Yun, Sir says you&#39;re riding back in the same car as him.</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.760" end="01:14:29.360" style="s2">Me?</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.000" end="01:14:35.120" style="s2">I absolutely must not react to his inner thoughts.</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.720" end="01:14:37.399" style="s2">Just pretend I&#39;m deaf.</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.400" end="01:14:40.040" style="s2">It&#39;s kinda hot in this car.</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.400" end="01:14:41.480" style="s2">This XiaoYunYang...</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.200" end="01:14:44.839" style="s2">Zero situational awareness. When we get back, that box of gold bars of hers—</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.840" end="01:14:45.799" style="s2">Confiscated.</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.800" end="01:14:47.840" style="s2">Gold bars? My gold bars!</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.920" end="01:14:51.920" style="s2">Sir, don&#39;t you feel a little...</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.360" end="01:14:56.479" style="s2">Don&#39;t you feel a little hungry? Want a beef burger?</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.480" end="01:14:58.519" style="s2">Fresh beef delivered to the kitchen this morning.</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.520" end="01:15:01.999" style="s2">Three days ago it was definitely a live cow. So, want some?</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.000" end="01:15:03.200" style="s2">I&#39;ll cook it for you when we get back.</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.680" end="01:15:06.440" style="s2">Wait... did I guess wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.560" end="01:15:09.800" style="s2">This man... he&#39;s definitely testing me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:26.120" end="01:15:28.520" style="s2">Sir? FuXiaoTing?</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.720" end="01:15:30.920" style="s2">He&#39;s passed out.</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.120" end="01:15:39.679" style="s2">The bodyguards look just as out cold. Right now...</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.680" end="01:15:42.080" style="s2">This is a once-in-a-lifetime chance to run.</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.160" end="01:15:56.360" style="s2">If I miss this, I&#39;ll never get another shot at leaving.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.680" end="01:15:59.720" style="s2">But leaving him here all alone...</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.600" end="01:16:04.520" style="s2">YuYang, snap out of it!</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.760" end="01:16:07.400" style="s2">He&#39;s FuXiaoTing. He&#39;s a fictional character.</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.240" end="01:16:10.400" style="s2">He&#39;s the villain who could end your life at any moment.</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.000" end="01:16:12.920" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry, but I have to go.</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.520" end="01:16:14.960" style="s2">I have to.</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.800" end="01:16:24.920" style="s2">FuXiaoTing, looks like today your time</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.040" end="01:16:26.240" style="s2">has run out.</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.560" end="01:16:38.839" style="s2">FuXiaoTing, this time</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.840" end="01:16:40.760" style="s2">you&#39;d better cough up ten chests of gold for me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.680" end="01:16:51.560" style="s2">FuXiaoTing!</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.800" end="01:16:52.760" style="s2">Don&#39;t!</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.960" end="01:16:56.840" style="s2">Sir, it&#39;s okay. I&#39;m YuYang.</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.600" end="01:17:03.800" style="s2">Sir, don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.880" end="01:17:08.000" style="s2">Butler Ju is definitely already looking for us. Before dark,</p>
<p begin="01:17:08.120" end="01:17:09.560" style="s2">he&#39;ll definitely find us.</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.360" end="01:17:27.080" style="s2">Sir, you&#39;re injured—you can&#39;t catch a cold. I&#39;m fine, really.</p>
<p begin="01:17:27.440" end="01:17:29.720" style="s2">If you don&#39;t want to freeze to death, put it on.</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.800" end="01:17:43.520" style="s2">Sir...</p>
<p begin="01:17:44.240" end="01:17:47.240" style="s2">It&#39;s just for warmth. Don&#39;t want to freeze? Then don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.720" end="01:17:51.439" style="s2">You can die from exposure here.</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.440" end="01:17:53.720" style="s2">Now&#39;s not the time for modesty.</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.280" end="01:18:04.040" style="s2">This XiaoYunYang, seems like</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.160" end="01:18:06.800" style="s2">he&#39;s not that annoying after all. Actually...</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.640" end="01:18:08.720" style="s2">kind of good-looking.</p>
<p begin="01:18:09.920" end="01:18:11.960" style="s2">You&#39;re... good-looking too.</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.800" end="01:18:13.520" style="s2">YuYang.</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.360" end="01:18:16.880" style="s2">You can hear my thoughts, can&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.800" end="01:18:26.120" style="s2">Sir, you&#39;re seriously too good-looking. Your face is absolutely</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.240" end="01:18:28.040" style="s2">divine craftsmanship—a goddess-tier masterpiece.</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.760" end="01:18:33.079" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t help it. I fell asleep and dreamed—</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.080" end="01:18:34.520" style="s2">and spilled all the truth in my dream.</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.560" end="01:18:37.280" style="s2">Sir</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.880" end="01:18:39.200" style="s2">Are you in there?</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.520" end="01:18:45.680" style="s2">Sir, you&#39;re hurt!</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.640" end="01:18:47.960" style="s2">Quick, get a doctor!</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.920" end="01:19:07.159" style="s2">Sir, you barely ate anything back in that cave.</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.160" end="01:19:10.520" style="s2">Your stomach won&#39;t handle it. I made some desserts—please try them.</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.400" end="01:19:21.919" style="s2">Back on the mountain, weren&#39;t you mentally going on about</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.920" end="01:19:25.759" style="s2">wanting something sweet? Well, I made them savory on purpose.</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.760" end="01:19:28.999" style="s2">Now you&#39;ll have to believe it was just a lucky guess—</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.000" end="01:19:31.280" style="s2">that I can&#39;t actually hear your thoughts at all.</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.200" end="01:19:34.160" style="s2">Get out.</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.880" end="01:19:36.800" style="s2">Enjoy your meal then, Sir.</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.080" end="01:19:44.000" style="s2">Idiot. Can&#39;t even fake it right.</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.720" end="01:19:47.960" style="s2">I never once said I wanted rabbit-shaped pastries.</p>
<p begin="01:20:19.880" end="01:20:23.120" style="s2">Sir, you must be starving after that cave.</p>
<p begin="01:20:23.720" end="01:20:24.680" style="s2">I made dessert.</p>
<p begin="01:20:28.760" end="01:20:29.720" style="s2">So damn noisy.</p>
<p begin="01:20:41.360" end="01:20:44.719" style="s2">Why does he eat whatever YuYang brings him? System!</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.720" end="01:20:48.440" style="s2">Pull up every recipe right now—Western, Chinese, all of them!</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.760" end="01:21:02.839" style="s2">Why would he risk his life to save me? And take care of me like that?</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.840" end="01:21:03.560" style="s2">FuXiaoTing...</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.040" end="01:21:06.920" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t seem as heartless as the novel made him out to be.</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.080" end="01:21:12.920" style="s2">Sir, your wound is healing nicely. Just change the dressing on time.</p>
<p begin="01:21:18.200" end="01:21:20.120" style="s2">Sir, what would you like for breakfast?</p>
<p begin="01:21:21.320" end="01:21:23.720" style="s2">Baozi... sounds pretty good.</p>
<p begin="01:21:25.520" end="01:21:28.760" style="s2">The kitchen just got some pork in. I&#39;ll make you soup dumplings.</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.000" end="01:21:30.080" style="s2">Thin skin, rich broth.</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.960" end="01:21:34.160" style="s2">On it!</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.840" end="01:21:46.760" style="s2">Sir, we caught the man.</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.120" end="01:21:56.840" style="s2">He says—</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.960" end="01:22:20.000" style="s2">Sir, your breakfast.</p>
<p begin="01:22:21.200" end="01:22:22.280" style="s2">I&#39;ll head down first.</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.960" end="01:22:32.600" style="s2">Eating alone... what&#39;s the point?</p>
<p begin="01:22:40.040" end="01:22:42.799" style="s2">This is a novel world—a place where, for the sake of plot conflict,</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.800" end="01:22:44.240" style="s2">human life means nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:22:44.840" end="01:22:46.039" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing but a</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.040" end="01:22:49.640" style="s2">Minor character, disposable anytime. His kindness to you</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.760" end="01:22:51.560" style="s2">is only because you&#39;re still useful to him—</p>
<p begin="01:22:51.800" end="01:22:52.880" style="s2">you can fill his stomach.</p>
<p begin="01:22:54.320" end="01:22:56.360" style="s2">YuYang, don&#39;t be stupid. Don&#39;t get confused.</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.480" end="01:22:58.040" style="s2">You need to find a way out of here.</p>
<p begin="01:23:01.640" end="01:23:03.920" style="s2">Butler Yun, the Master says—ten o&#39;clock tonight,</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.040" end="01:23:05.120" style="s2">he wants you to come prepare the midnight snack.</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.720" end="01:23:07.040" style="s2">Again?!</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.640" end="01:23:09.680" style="s2">Does he really think I&#39;m a 24-hour kitchen?</p>
<p begin="01:23:10.760" end="01:23:11.720" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:23:18.080" end="01:23:22.159" style="s2">Tyrant. Overlord. Killed someone this morning, tonight he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:23:22.160" end="01:23:25.040" style="s2">calmly ordering people around to cook for him. Inhuman.</p>
<p begin="01:23:32.120" end="01:23:33.800" style="s2">Sir, the midnight snack is ready.</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.880" end="01:23:38.720" style="s2">This is tanghulu—my hometown recipe. Lightly sweet, not cloying.</p>
<p begin="01:23:39.080" end="01:23:39.680" style="s2">Try it.</p>
<p begin="01:23:40.040" end="01:23:41.360" style="s2">Sit down and eat with me.</p>
<p begin="01:23:42.080" end="01:23:45.080" style="s2">Sir, I—I already had dinner. I&#39;m really not hungry at all.</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.520" end="01:23:47.480" style="s2">Sit.</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.160" end="01:23:59.120" style="s2">When I was a kid,</p>
<p begin="01:24:00.320" end="01:24:02.360" style="s2">my father tried everything—poison,</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.200" end="01:24:06.920" style="s2">staged accidents, even sending people to do it themselves.</p>
<p begin="01:24:08.360" end="01:24:11.840" style="s2">Now that I&#39;m grown, there are only more people who want me dead.</p>
<p begin="01:24:12.080" end="01:24:13.160" style="s2">If I don&#39;t strike first,</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.960" end="01:24:16.160" style="s2">I&#39;m the one who ends up dead.</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.640" end="01:24:19.400" style="s2">Why is he suddenly telling me all this?</p>
<p begin="01:24:20.000" end="01:24:22.400" style="s2">Don&#39;t be afraid of me. Okay?</p>
<p begin="01:24:23.600" end="01:24:24.440" style="s2">Sir?</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.160" end="01:24:28.640" style="s2">The sugar shell is best right now—it&#39;ll melt soon.</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.880" end="01:24:34.160" style="s2">Alright, I&#39;ll eat with you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:41.480" end="01:24:42.440" style="s2">So sweet.</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.640" end="01:24:46.760" style="s2">The novel only described him as a brutal, cold-blooded villain.</p>
<p begin="01:24:47.120" end="01:24:50.839" style="s2">But his mother died young, his father was a monster, and growing up—</p>
<p begin="01:24:50.840" end="01:24:53.960" style="s2">he was always dancing on the edge of a blade. Some choices—</p>
<p begin="01:24:54.200" end="01:24:57.200" style="s2">maybe he didn&#39;t get to make them. Maybe he had no choice at all.</p>
<p begin="01:24:57.800" end="01:25:01.640" style="s2">Sir, if you like it, I can make it for you often from now on.</p>
<p begin="01:25:02.240" end="01:25:06.559" style="s2">I know tons of snacks. Besides candied hawthorn, there&#39;s also—</p>
<p begin="01:25:06.560" end="01:25:10.280" style="s2">candy paintings, dragon beard candy, pea cakes—I can make them all.</p>
<p begin="01:25:10.760" end="01:25:13.520" style="s2">My mom taught me how to make them when I was little.</p>
<p begin="01:25:16.400" end="01:25:17.120" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.280" end="01:25:23.000" style="s2">Nothing. It&#39;s just... I suddenly miss home a bit.</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.720" end="01:25:27.080" style="s2">I haven&#39;t sent any word in so many days. My parents must be worried sick.</p>
<p begin="01:25:30.080" end="01:25:34.400" style="s2">Wait. The file on this body says she&#39;s an orphan.</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.240" end="01:25:37.280" style="s2">For making a decent candied hawthorn skewer—</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.480" end="01:25:39.560" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you another reward.</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.280" end="01:25:42.320" style="s2">Go on. What do you want?</p>
<p begin="01:25:42.920" end="01:25:45.559" style="s2">Phew, that was close. He probably hasn&#39;t read that file.</p>
<p begin="01:25:45.560" end="01:25:46.760" style="s2">Or he just doesn&#39;t care.</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.480" end="01:25:48.080" style="s2">Then...</p>
<p begin="01:25:48.800" end="01:25:49.880" style="s2">I want this.</p>
<p begin="01:25:53.480" end="01:25:55.160" style="s2">Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="01:25:55.760" end="01:25:59.360" style="s2">He treasures this thing so much—it&#39;s gotta be worth a fortune. With this,</p>
<p begin="01:25:59.720" end="01:26:01.640" style="s2">my escape fund just got a whole lot bigger.</p>
<p begin="01:26:07.520" end="01:26:08.240" style="s2">Average.</p>
<p begin="01:26:08.960" end="01:26:10.520" style="s2">XiaoYunYang looks so good.</p>
<p begin="01:26:12.200" end="01:26:13.280" style="s2">Stubborn.</p>
<p begin="01:26:22.400" end="01:26:23.720" style="s2">Move YuYang to the master guest room.</p>
<p begin="01:26:24.560" end="01:26:29.120" style="s2">Sir, you want to move Butler Yun to the master guest room in the main building?</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.400" end="01:26:33.560" style="s2">Yes. Do it now.</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.800" end="01:26:37.760" style="s2">Sir.</p>
<p begin="01:26:38.480" end="01:26:39.560" style="s2">Your mother&#39;s keepsake.</p>
<p begin="01:26:40.160" end="01:26:43.639" style="s2">That&#39;s the token for the future lady of Ravencrest Estate. You never take it off.</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.640" end="01:26:44.720" style="s2">So why today...</p>
<p begin="01:26:45.680" end="01:26:46.760" style="s2">The lady of Ravencrest Estate.</p>
<p begin="01:26:47.360" end="01:26:49.400" style="s2">If it really is that XiaoYunYang...</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.880" end="01:26:52.520" style="s2">Maybe that&#39;s not so bad.</p>
<p begin="01:26:56.000" end="01:26:56.840" style="s2">Butler Yun.</p>
<p begin="01:26:57.800" end="01:27:01.880" style="s2">The Master has ordered that from now on, this is your room.</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.480" end="01:27:07.400" style="s2">This... is really for me to live in?</p>
<p begin="01:27:27.800" end="01:27:30.080" style="s2">I&#39;ve seriously hit the jackpot now.</p>
<p begin="01:27:33.320" end="01:27:35.000" style="s2">What a tacky bumpkin.</p>
<p begin="01:27:41.480" end="01:27:43.280" style="s2">This place is way too nice.</p>
<p begin="01:27:44.000" end="01:27:45.800" style="s2">The Master gave her the necklace.</p>
<p begin="01:27:47.960" end="01:27:48.800" style="s2">Butler Yun.</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.480" end="01:27:50.840" style="s2">Miss Yun.</p>
<p begin="01:27:51.800" end="01:27:54.320" style="s2">If you need anything at all, just say the word.</p>
<p begin="01:27:55.760" end="01:27:56.720" style="s2">What&#39;s up with Butler Ji?</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.440" end="01:27:58.159" style="s2">Did he take the wrong meds?</p>
<p begin="01:28:02.000" end="01:28:05.360" style="s2">The Master is seriously too good to Butler Yun. That room...</p>
<p begin="01:28:05.600" end="01:28:08.240" style="s2">That room used to be for royal VIP guests. Right?</p>
<p begin="01:28:08.360" end="01:28:10.880" style="s2">Even Sister An doesn&#39;t have her own room. She still lives with us.</p>
<p begin="01:28:11.360" end="01:28:13.159" style="s2">But Butler Yun is a good person. She helped us before...</p>
<p begin="01:28:13.160" end="01:28:15.800" style="s2">She fought for our bonuses. She deserves a nicer place.</p>
<p begin="01:28:16.040" end="01:28:17.000" style="s2">Are you all done with your work?</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.720" end="01:28:18.920" style="s2">Just standing around here gossiping.</p>
<p begin="01:28:23.360" end="01:28:25.400" style="s2">YuYang, just you wait.</p>
<p begin="01:28:26.600" end="01:28:28.400" style="s2">I&#39;m not going down without a fight.</p>
<p begin="01:28:49.760" end="01:28:51.920" style="s2">Now this is what I call living.</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.640" end="01:28:56.480" style="s2">Who&#39;s there?</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.880" end="01:29:05.840" style="s2">Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:29:06.200" end="01:29:07.040" style="s2">Changing the dressing.</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.880" end="01:29:08.720" style="s2">Changing the dressing.</p>
<p begin="01:29:09.440" end="01:29:12.560" style="s2">Where&#39;s Butler Ju? Want me to call a doctor for you?</p>
<p begin="01:29:13.040" end="01:29:14.360" style="s2">JuJiLuo has already gone to rest.</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.960" end="01:29:16.520" style="s2">The doctor&#39;s off duty.</p>
<p begin="01:29:18.680" end="01:29:20.240" style="s2">But—</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.240" end="01:29:29.360" style="s2">Damn, that body is no joke.</p>
<p begin="01:29:39.560" end="01:29:41.119" style="s2">This XiaoYunYang...</p>
<p begin="01:29:41.120" end="01:29:45.440" style="s2">Whatever you do, don&#39;t touch my chest and abs—I&#39;m ticklish as hell.</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.360" end="01:29:48.320" style="s2">Ticklish, huh?</p>
<p begin="01:29:49.040" end="01:29:50.840" style="s2">That&#39;s for always ordering me around.</p>
<p begin="01:29:53.240" end="01:29:54.920" style="s2">Sir, I&#39;m starting now.</p>
<p begin="01:30:11.240" end="01:30:14.480" style="s2">So you ARE ticklish. Playing it all cool, huh?</p>
<p begin="01:30:15.200" end="01:30:17.480" style="s2">Sir, your muscles are insanely tense.</p>
<p begin="01:30:17.840" end="01:30:20.960" style="s2">Are you feeling unwell somewhere? Want me to—</p>
<p begin="01:30:21.080" end="01:30:22.160" style="s2">take a look?</p>
<p begin="01:30:28.400" end="01:30:32.960" style="s2">This feel... these lines... absolutely irresistible.</p>
<p begin="01:30:52.160" end="01:30:56.120" style="s2">This time it&#39;ll work. Once she signs the document,</p>
<p begin="01:30:56.600" end="01:31:00.800" style="s2">I&#39;ll go straight to Sir and expose her for embezzling.</p>
<p begin="01:31:01.280" end="01:31:02.600" style="s2">Brilliant move, Host.</p>
<p begin="01:31:07.520" end="01:31:09.080" style="s2">YuYang, are you out of your mind?</p>
<p begin="01:31:09.320" end="01:31:11.000" style="s2">Hiding a man in your room?!</p>
<p begin="01:31:13.640" end="01:31:14.120" style="s2">Sir—</p>
<p begin="01:31:15.200" end="01:31:17.240" style="s2">Sorry, wrong room.</p>
<p begin="01:31:21.080" end="01:31:23.960" style="s2">Dressing is done. Sir, you should hurry back.</p>
<p begin="01:31:24.680" end="01:31:26.120" style="s2">Scared that badly?</p>
<p begin="01:31:26.360" end="01:31:28.520" style="s2">Just as I thought—a timid little XiaoYunYang.</p>
<p begin="01:31:38.240" end="01:31:39.320" style="s2">Amituofo.</p>
<p begin="01:31:40.040" end="01:31:41.840" style="s2">Beauty truly is a dangerous thing.</p>
<p begin="01:31:48.680" end="01:31:49.520" style="s2">Warning! Warning!</p>
<p begin="01:31:50.240" end="01:31:52.879" style="s2">Host, target FuXiaoTing</p>
<p begin="01:31:52.880" end="01:31:55.879" style="s2">Your affection level is dropping drastically. Current value: five.</p>
<p begin="01:31:55.880" end="01:31:58.040" style="s2">Approaching critical threshold. Five.</p>
<p begin="01:31:59.960" end="01:32:02.120" style="s2">YuYang, it&#39;s all your fault!</p>
<p begin="01:32:05.600" end="01:32:06.799" style="s2">How could I forget about that idiot</p>
<p begin="01:32:06.800" end="01:32:08.360" style="s2">ShenMingYue?!</p>
<p begin="01:32:09.440" end="01:32:10.160" style="s2">This time</p>
<p begin="01:32:11.120" end="01:32:12.319" style="s2">I&#39;m definitely gonna make FuXiaoTing&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.320" end="01:32:15.080" style="s2">affection level for me shoot way up!</p>
<p begin="01:32:26.960" end="01:32:29.839" style="s2">Hey maid, go whip me up something delicious, now!</p>
<p begin="01:32:29.840" end="01:32:32.000" style="s2">My family chef&#39;s cooking is literally pig slop.</p>
<p begin="01:32:43.400" end="01:32:46.639" style="s2">Sneaking off again?</p>
<p begin="01:32:46.640" end="01:32:48.199" style="s2">I sent you there to get close to FuXiaoTing,</p>
<p begin="01:32:48.200" end="01:32:50.360" style="s2">not to be a damn freeloader! Today you better—</p>
<p begin="01:32:52.640" end="01:32:53.600" style="s2">Ugh, so annoying!</p>
<p begin="01:33:00.200" end="01:33:00.680" style="s2">Delicious!</p>
<p begin="01:33:01.640" end="01:33:03.800" style="s2">Make me more of that spicy crayfish you mentioned!</p>
<p begin="01:33:05.000" end="01:33:08.119" style="s2">This spoiled brat does nothing but eat all day long.</p>
<p begin="01:33:08.120" end="01:33:09.079" style="s2">With FuXiaoTing,</p>
<p begin="01:33:09.080" end="01:33:11.839" style="s2">I barely even see him twice a day. This plot—</p>
<p begin="01:33:11.840" end="01:33:14.000" style="s2">How the hell am I supposed to finish it at this rate?!</p>
<p begin="01:33:22.160" end="01:33:23.120" style="s2">Thanks.</p>
<p begin="01:33:24.320" end="01:33:25.760" style="s2">Go deliver this to FuXiaoTing.</p>
<p begin="01:33:26.000" end="01:33:27.080" style="s2">He should like it.</p>
<p begin="01:33:29.240" end="01:33:30.800" style="s2">Finally remembered she&#39;s supposed to capture the male lead!</p>
<p begin="01:33:51.560" end="01:33:53.600" style="s2">I laced the fried chicken with double the laxatives</p>
<p begin="01:33:54.200" end="01:33:55.880" style="s2">and stole every last roll of toilet paper.</p>
<p begin="01:33:56.000" end="01:33:56.839" style="s2">FuXiaoTing,</p>
<p begin="01:33:56.840" end="01:34:00.560" style="s2">Hope you enjoy the feeling of dying with your crap held in!</p>
<p begin="01:34:01.400" end="01:34:03.200" style="s2">Let&#39;s see who dares force me to marry you now!</p>
<p begin="01:34:07.520" end="01:34:09.679" style="s2">Every day, cooking for these two little tyrants.</p>
<p begin="01:34:09.680" end="01:34:11.480" style="s2">I&#39;m so hungry my stomach&#39;s growling.</p>
<p begin="01:34:18.560" end="01:34:21.080" style="s2">System, good thing you reminded me.</p>
<p begin="01:34:21.800" end="01:34:24.320" style="s2">I swapped that idiot ShenMingYue&#39;s laxatives</p>
<p begin="01:34:24.440" end="01:34:26.240" style="s2">for some messed-up powder instead.</p>
<p begin="01:34:27.200" end="01:34:28.639" style="s2">Once FuXiaoTing and I</p>
<p begin="01:34:28.640" end="01:34:31.760" style="s2">seal the deal, everything at Ravencrest Estate</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.480" end="01:34:33.920" style="s2">will be mine.</p>
<p begin="01:34:35.600" end="01:34:38.360" style="s2">Sir, Miss Shen asked me to bring you a midnight snack.</p>
<p begin="01:34:41.480" end="01:34:42.440" style="s2">Sir.</p>
<p begin="01:34:43.040" end="01:34:44.120" style="s2">Are you in the shower?</p>
<p begin="01:34:51.200" end="01:34:52.160" style="s2">Weird.</p>
<p begin="01:34:53.120" end="01:34:54.440" style="s2">Why does it feel so hot?</p>
<p begin="01:34:55.640" end="01:34:57.200" style="s2">Did someone crank up the heating?</p>
<p begin="01:35:02.480" end="01:35:04.520" style="s2">Suddenly so hot.</p>
<p begin="01:35:09.680" end="01:35:11.239" style="s2">You must be AnJing. I&#39;m starving.</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.240" end="01:35:12.440" style="s2">Go make me some pig trotters.</p>
<p begin="01:35:13.040" end="01:35:14.840" style="s2">Let go of me, Miss Shen. I&#39;ve got things to do.</p>
<p begin="01:35:16.760" end="01:35:19.880" style="s2">What things could possibly be more important than me eating? Move!</p>
<p begin="01:35:26.000" end="01:35:26.840" style="s2">You—</p>
<p begin="01:35:29.480" end="01:35:30.440" style="s2">FuXiaoTing.</p>
<p begin="01:35:34.760" end="01:35:35.720" style="s2">I&#39;m so hot.</p>
<p begin="01:35:36.320" end="01:35:37.400" style="s2">I feel awful.</p>
<p begin="01:35:42.680" end="01:35:45.200" style="s2">YuYang, do you even know who I am?</p>
<p begin="01:35:45.560" end="01:35:46.640" style="s2">You&#39;re—</p>
<p begin="01:35:50.960" end="01:35:51.920" style="s2">FuXiaoTing.</p>
<p begin="01:36:22.280" end="01:36:22.880" style="s2">Oh no, oh no.</p>
<p begin="01:36:23.960" end="01:36:25.400" style="s2">YuYang, how dare you!</p>
<p begin="01:36:25.760" end="01:36:27.080" style="s2">That&#39;s FuXiaoTing!</p>
<p begin="01:36:27.920" end="01:36:28.880" style="s2">Are you insane?!</p>
<p begin="01:36:30.920" end="01:36:33.200" style="s2">He&#39;s gone—time to slip out.</p>
<p begin="01:36:35.360" end="01:36:38.480" style="s2">Just treat it like a nightmare. Yeah, a nightmare.</p>
<p begin="01:36:41.120" end="01:36:41.720" style="s2">And where do you think you&#39;re going?</p>
<p begin="01:36:48.080" end="01:36:51.440" style="s2">Sir, you&#39;re awake. Um, about last night—it was just an accident.</p>
<p begin="01:36:51.800" end="01:36:54.560" style="s2">I don&#39;t even remember it, so don&#39;t give it another thought.</p>
<p begin="01:36:55.040" end="01:36:56.960" style="s2">Um, I—I&#39;ll go get to work now.</p>
<p begin="01:37:05.960" end="01:37:07.880" style="s2">An accident. Don&#39;t remember.</p>
<p begin="01:37:08.480" end="01:37:11.360" style="s2">Really! I must&#39;ve been sleepwalking last night.</p>
<p begin="01:37:12.080" end="01:37:13.520" style="s2">Please, have mercy on me.</p>
<p begin="01:37:13.760" end="01:37:14.720" style="s2">XiaoYunYang.</p>
<p begin="01:37:15.560" end="01:37:17.839" style="s2">Last night, you were the one who undressed me.</p>
<p begin="01:37:17.840" end="01:37:20.120" style="s2">Over and over you said you liked me. That was you.</p>
<p begin="01:37:20.840" end="01:37:24.200" style="s2">What the hell? This bastard—why&#39;s there no inner voice coming through?</p>
<p begin="01:37:24.560" end="01:37:25.400" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me he wants to—</p>
<p begin="01:37:26.600" end="01:37:28.759" style="s2">Sleep with a hot young thing like me?</p>
<p begin="01:37:28.760" end="01:37:30.079" style="s2">Honestly, he&#39;d be the lucky one here!</p>
<p begin="01:37:30.080" end="01:37:32.239" style="s2">What&#39;s that sound? Don&#39;t tell me—</p>
<p begin="01:37:32.240" end="01:37:33.320" style="s2">That&#39;s XiaoYunYang&#39;s inner voice!</p>
<p begin="01:37:33.680" end="01:37:36.320" style="s2">Sir, it really was just an accident, I swear.</p>
<p begin="01:37:36.440" end="01:37:37.760" style="s2">It&#39;ll never happen again.</p>
<p begin="01:37:38.360" end="01:37:42.080" style="s2">Could you just—pretend it was a cat scratch?</p>
<p begin="01:37:44.000" end="01:37:47.239" style="s2">Dude, just kill me or torture me already—say something!</p>
<p begin="01:37:47.240" end="01:37:50.240" style="s2">What&#39;s with the staring? There&#39;s nothing on my face.</p>
<p begin="01:37:51.320" end="01:37:54.080" style="s2">There it is again. So it&#39;s not my imagination.</p>
<p begin="01:37:55.160" end="01:37:57.080" style="s2">And what if I say I can&#39;t?</p>
<p begin="01:37:59.000" end="01:38:00.440" style="s2">Then what do you want?</p>
<p begin="01:38:01.760" end="01:38:04.639" style="s2">This bastard—why can&#39;t his heart be as big as his... other parts?</p>
<p begin="01:38:04.640" end="01:38:05.720" style="s2">I&#39;m still sore, you know.</p>
<p begin="01:38:06.080" end="01:38:08.479" style="s2">So it seems last night&#39;s service, XiaoYunYang—</p>
<p begin="01:38:08.480" end="01:38:09.440" style="s2">—was very satisfying.</p>
<p begin="01:38:10.640" end="01:38:11.360" style="s2">Get out.</p>
<p begin="01:38:11.480" end="01:38:14.719" style="s2">So weird—his mind&#39;s been totally offline today.</p>
<p begin="01:38:14.720" end="01:38:16.760" style="s2">This quiet? He must be brewing something bigger.</p>
<p begin="01:38:17.360" end="01:38:20.600" style="s2">Yes, sir. I&#39;ll get out and start on breakfast right away.</p>
<p begin="01:38:25.880" end="01:38:26.960" style="s2">XiaoYunYang</p>
<p begin="01:38:27.560" end="01:38:30.320" style="s2">Time to switch up the game plan for what&#39;s coming next.</p>
<p begin="01:38:33.080" end="01:38:37.999" style="s2">Clothed, he seems decent, but last night...</p>
<p begin="01:38:38.000" end="01:38:42.679" style="s2">was such a beast. Those broad shoulders, narrow waist, long legs—stop.</p>
<p begin="01:38:42.680" end="01:38:45.320" style="s2">YuYang, snap out of it!</p>
<p begin="01:38:49.400" end="01:38:53.479" style="s2">Standing is exhausting; my back aches, legs weak.</p>
<p begin="01:38:53.480" end="01:38:54.680" style="s2">Last night though...</p>
<p begin="01:38:55.760" end="01:38:57.560" style="s2">Maybe a little too much.</p>
<p begin="01:39:01.880" end="01:39:04.760" style="s2">Please spare me, Sir! I—I didn&#39;t mean it!</p>
<p begin="01:39:05.480" end="01:39:08.359" style="s2">Oh crap. That rug looks stupid expensive.</p>
<p begin="01:39:08.360" end="01:39:09.680" style="s2">This girl is screwed.</p>
<p begin="01:39:20.360" end="01:39:25.160" style="s2">Orders from Sir: all maids get a paid day off today.</p>
<p begin="01:39:31.520" end="01:39:34.520" style="s2">Thank you, Sir!</p>
<p begin="01:39:39.800" end="01:39:43.039" style="s2">One night of sleep and it&#39;s like this bastard actually grew a soul.</p>
<p begin="01:39:43.040" end="01:39:45.200" style="s2">He&#39;s more tuned in than a mind reader.</p>
<p begin="01:39:50.840" end="01:39:53.959" style="s2">Something&#39;s off. Way off. From this morning till now,</p>
<p begin="01:39:53.960" end="01:39:57.319" style="s2">I haven&#39;t heard a single thought. Don&#39;t tell me—</p>
<p begin="01:39:57.320" end="01:39:58.880" style="s2">my mind-reading ability is gone?</p>
<p begin="01:40:02.000" end="01:40:04.759" style="s2">This XiaoYunYang—after all this time,</p>
<p begin="01:40:04.760" end="01:40:06.080" style="s2">finally figured it out.</p>
<p begin="01:40:11.240" end="01:40:13.520" style="s2">Sir, I spent all night making these pork trotters.</p>
<p begin="01:40:13.760" end="01:40:17.000" style="s2">I guarantee they taste amazing. Would you... try some?</p>
<p begin="01:40:17.720" end="01:40:19.520" style="s2">Why do these pork trotters smell spoiled?</p>
<p begin="01:40:20.240" end="01:40:22.039" style="s2">Sure enough, no one compares to XiaoYunYang.</p>
<p begin="01:40:22.040" end="01:40:23.119" style="s2">Warning, Host.</p>
<p begin="01:40:23.120" end="01:40:24.439" style="s2">FuXiaoTing&#39;s affection level for you</p>
<p begin="01:40:25.160" end="01:40:27.919" style="s2">has dropped again. Current level: zero. If it goes negative,</p>
<p begin="01:40:27.920" end="01:40:29.840" style="s2">you will be forcibly expelled from Ravencrest Estate.</p>
<p begin="01:40:37.280" end="01:40:40.040" style="s2">No. I have to find a way to get my mind-reading ability back.</p>
<p begin="01:40:42.680" end="01:40:44.600" style="s2">No time to hesitate anymore, YuYang.</p>
<p begin="01:40:44.960" end="01:40:47.360" style="s2">Be honest with me. Do you have mind-reading ability?</p>
<p begin="01:40:48.680" end="01:40:49.280" style="s2">How does she know?</p>
<p begin="01:40:59.240" end="01:41:02.360" style="s2">That test note from last time—could it have been her?</p>
<p begin="01:41:03.080" end="01:41:05.960" style="s2">What are you talking about? What mind-reading? I—</p>
<p begin="01:41:06.920" end="01:41:07.280" style="s2">I don&#39;t know what you mean.</p>
<p begin="01:41:08.240" end="01:41:09.200" style="s2">Still playing dumb.</p>
<p begin="01:41:10.160" end="01:41:13.519" style="s2">Are you done? Believe it or don&#39;t. I used to have it.</p>
<p begin="01:41:13.520" end="01:41:15.679" style="s2">Now it just up and vanished. I&#39;m the one losing my mind over here.</p>
<p begin="01:41:16.040" end="01:41:17.120" style="s2">You forced my hand.</p>
<p begin="01:41:17.960" end="01:41:20.720" style="s2">System, immediate judgment. Target: YuYang.</p>
<p begin="01:41:21.080" end="01:41:23.719" style="s2">Final judgment protocol initiated. Reminder:</p>
<p begin="01:41:23.720" end="01:41:26.599" style="s2">Host has only one judgment attempt. If the judgment is wrong—</p>
<p begin="01:41:26.600" end="01:41:26.959" style="s2">the Host will be erased.</p>
<p begin="01:41:27.800" end="01:41:29.000" style="s2">Confirm?</p>
<p begin="01:41:36.560" end="01:41:37.400" style="s2">Look closely.</p>
<p begin="01:41:39.200" end="01:41:42.320" style="s2">Once or twice could be coincidence. No way it&#39;s every single time.</p>
<p begin="01:41:42.560" end="01:41:44.480" style="s2">The mind-reading ability has to be on her.</p>
<p begin="01:41:45.080" end="01:41:47.719" style="s2">I confirm. Judgment failed. Target: YuYang.</p>
<p begin="01:41:47.720" end="01:41:50.960" style="s2">Does not possess mind-reading ability. Judgment error. Executing erasure.</p>
<p begin="01:41:51.680" end="01:41:54.320" style="s2">I don&#39;t believe it, YuYang.</p>
<p begin="01:41:54.920" end="01:41:56.240" style="s2">It has to be your doing.</p>
<p begin="01:42:02.960" end="01:42:05.480" style="s2">Impossible. The mind-reading ability must be on you.</p>
<p begin="01:42:06.080" end="01:42:10.160" style="s2">YuYang, just you wait. Erasure protocol in progress.</p>
<p begin="01:42:16.280" end="01:42:18.080" style="s2">Playing tricks and summoning spirits. Drag her out!</p>
<p begin="01:42:22.400" end="01:42:25.280" style="s2">What the hell just happened? The way she looked just now—she really seemed possessed.</p>
<p begin="01:42:25.400" end="01:42:26.960" style="s2">YuYang, you okay?</p>
<p begin="01:42:27.560" end="01:42:28.040" style="s2">I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="01:42:40.640" end="01:42:43.039" style="s2">I have to get the mind-reading ability back fast.</p>
<p begin="01:42:43.040" end="01:42:45.439" style="s2">What if I end up like AnJing?</p>
<p begin="01:42:45.440" end="01:42:47.599" style="s2">Wait—it was from this morning.</p>
<p begin="01:42:47.600" end="01:42:48.920" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t hear FuXiaoTing&#39;s thoughts.</p>
<p begin="01:42:49.760" end="01:42:53.480" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me last night with him—shook the mind-reading right out of me.</p>
<p begin="01:42:53.600" end="01:42:54.920" style="s2">Finally, the penny drops.</p>
<p begin="01:42:55.280" end="01:42:56.240" style="s2">My dear XiaoYunYang.</p>
<p begin="01:42:56.840" end="01:42:59.480" style="s2">If it really was physical contact with him that made it disappear—</p>
<p begin="01:43:00.080" end="01:43:03.080" style="s2">then maybe another round of contact would bring it back?</p>
<p begin="01:43:10.280" end="01:43:11.240" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:43:23.360" end="01:43:25.639" style="s2">Is it back? It should be back by now.</p>
<p begin="01:43:26.120" end="01:43:27.680" style="s2">Let me hear what he&#39;s thinking.</p>
<p begin="01:43:27.920" end="01:43:30.560" style="s2">Idiot. Thought you could just take it back like that?</p>
<p begin="01:43:31.520" end="01:43:34.400" style="s2">No way. I want my mind-reading ability back!</p>
<p begin="01:43:35.480" end="01:43:36.440" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this what you wanted?</p>
<p begin="01:43:38.720" end="01:43:39.560" style="s2">I&#39;ll give it to you.</p>
<p begin="01:43:44.000" end="01:43:47.000" style="s2">Wait—do we really have to go this far?</p>
<p begin="01:43:53.840" end="01:43:56.000" style="s2">This XiaoYunYang... when he&#39;s asleep...</p>
<p begin="01:43:56.720" end="01:43:58.880" style="s2">...he&#39;s way more well-behaved than when he&#39;s all claws and fangs.</p>
<p begin="01:44:04.160" end="01:44:07.159" style="s2">I hear it! I hear it! The mind-reading is back!</p>
<p begin="01:44:07.160" end="01:44:09.440" style="s2">It&#39;s really back, Sir.</p>
<p begin="01:44:10.040" end="01:44:13.880" style="s2">Last night... I had too much to drink. I was going to—</p>
<p begin="01:44:16.760" end="01:44:19.880" style="s2">—help you get your mind-reading back, and then I was planning to—</p>
<p begin="01:44:20.120" end="01:44:21.320" style="s2">—pull up my pants and walk out.</p>
<p begin="01:44:21.920" end="01:44:23.720" style="s2">How did you know... that what I wanted was the mind-reading ability?</p>
<p begin="01:44:25.400" end="01:44:26.360" style="s2">What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:44:27.320" end="01:44:29.120" style="s2">Drop the act. Keep playing dumb.</p>
<p begin="01:44:29.720" end="01:44:30.680" style="s2">FuXiaoTing.</p>
<p begin="01:44:31.280" end="01:44:32.600" style="s2">Did you know from the very beginning...</p>
<p begin="01:44:32.840" end="01:44:34.160" style="s2">...that I can hear the voice in your heart?</p>
<p begin="01:44:34.640" end="01:44:35.360" style="s2">You&#39;re angry.</p>
<p begin="01:44:36.080" end="01:44:37.760" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll punish myself.</p>
<p begin="01:44:38.960" end="01:44:39.920" style="s2">One more round.</p>
<p begin="01:44:42.920" end="01:44:43.880" style="s2">FuXiaoTing, you—</p>
<p begin="01:44:50.120" end="01:44:51.679" style="s2">FuXiaoTing, you damn dog of a man!</p>
<p begin="01:44:51.680" end="01:44:54.439" style="s2">Is he powered by a motor or what? Days in a row—</p>
<p begin="01:44:54.440" end="01:44:56.600" style="s2">My poor back is about to fall apart!</p>
<p begin="01:45:14.240" end="01:45:17.600" style="s2">Looks like things are pretty intense between you and Butler Yun!</p>
<p begin="01:45:17.840" end="01:45:18.800" style="s2">Intense? What are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="01:45:19.040" end="01:45:22.040" style="s2">Come on, spill it to your girls! Does that mute actually... you know... perform?</p>
<p begin="01:45:23.120" end="01:45:24.440" style="s2">What on earth are you saying?</p>
<p begin="01:45:24.680" end="01:45:26.839" style="s2">He&#39;s been shielding you from all the family pressure—</p>
<p begin="01:45:26.840" end="01:45:29.960" style="s2">—insisting on breaking off his engagement with me. Even a fool could figure that out.</p>
<p begin="01:45:30.200" end="01:45:30.920" style="s2">Tell us everything!</p>
<p begin="01:45:31.760" end="01:45:34.760" style="s2">Honestly? He&#39;s... actually pretty good.</p>
<p begin="01:45:35.840" end="01:45:39.560" style="s2">Looks like Ravencrest Estate is about to get a real lady of the house.</p>
<p begin="01:45:40.160" end="01:45:41.480" style="s2">What nonsense are you going on about?</p>
<p begin="01:45:42.080" end="01:45:45.319" style="s2">Oh, stop pretending. He even gave you his mother&#39;s most treasured keepsake—</p>
<p begin="01:45:45.320" end="01:45:47.960" style="s2">—and put it on you himself. Isn&#39;t that clear enough?</p>
<p begin="01:45:52.160" end="01:45:54.200" style="s2">This... this is his mother&#39;s keepsake.</p>
<p begin="01:45:55.280" end="01:45:56.840" style="s2">This girl is hopeless.</p>
<p begin="01:46:01.400" end="01:46:02.360" style="s2">After all this time here...</p>
<p begin="01:46:03.320" end="01:46:05.240" style="s2">I finally feel like this could be home.</p>
<p begin="01:46:06.560" end="01:46:10.279" style="s2">It&#39;s been so long. I wonder how Mom and Dad are doing.</p>
<p begin="01:46:10.280" end="01:46:12.920" style="s2">Host YuYang, System binding successful.</p>
<p begin="01:46:13.280" end="01:46:14.120" style="s2">Who&#39;s there?</p>
<p begin="01:46:14.240" end="01:46:16.159" style="s2">Congratulations, Host. Main quest:</p>
<p begin="01:46:16.160" end="01:46:17.839" style="s2">Capture target FuXiaoTing.</p>
<p begin="01:46:17.840" end="01:46:21.199" style="s2">Current completion at ninety percent. Once it reaches one hundred percent,</p>
<p begin="01:46:21.200" end="01:46:22.880" style="s2">you may return to your original world.</p>
<p begin="01:46:23.840" end="01:46:28.399" style="s2">I can go home. Isn&#39;t that the one goal I&#39;ve been obsessing over</p>
<p begin="01:46:28.400" end="01:46:32.359" style="s2">since I got transported into this novel? But... why...</p>
<p begin="01:46:32.360" end="01:46:34.160" style="s2">am I not as happy as I thought I&#39;d be?</p>
<p begin="01:46:34.520" end="01:46:34.999" style="s2">Alert.</p>
<p begin="01:46:35.000" end="01:46:36.439" style="s2">When FuXiaoTing officially proposes to the Host,</p>
<p begin="01:46:36.440" end="01:46:38.959" style="s2">and receives an affirmative answer, capture progress</p>
<p begin="01:46:38.960" end="01:46:41.600" style="s2">will immediately reach one hundred percent. The portal will open.</p>
<p begin="01:46:46.520" end="01:46:47.600" style="s2">What are you thinking about?</p>
<p begin="01:46:50.120" end="01:46:51.080" style="s2">Nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:47:00.440" end="01:47:01.280" style="s2">YuYang.</p>
<p begin="01:47:03.320" end="01:47:06.560" style="s2">Are you willing to stay by my side forever and become the lady of Ravencrest Estate?</p>
<p begin="01:47:08.600" end="01:47:11.359" style="s2">Congratulations, Host. The target has proposed. Say yes.</p>
<p begin="01:47:11.360" end="01:47:13.879" style="s2">Just say &quot;I do&quot; and the quest is complete.</p>
<p begin="01:47:13.880" end="01:47:15.560" style="s2">You can go home.</p>
<p begin="01:47:17.600" end="01:47:18.200" style="s2">I...</p>
<p begin="01:47:19.880" end="01:47:21.080" style="s2">FuXiaoTing...</p>
<p begin="01:47:21.680" end="01:47:24.080" style="s2">Marriage is a lifetime commitment.</p>
<p begin="01:47:26.720" end="01:47:27.920" style="s2">I need time...</p>
<p begin="01:47:28.520" end="01:47:29.840" style="s2">to think it over.</p>
<p begin="01:47:30.680" end="01:47:33.439" style="s2">Think it over? XiaoYunYang,</p>
<p begin="01:47:33.440" end="01:47:34.400" style="s2">you&#39;d better think carefully.</p>
<p begin="01:47:35.000" end="01:47:38.960" style="s2">I&#39;ve got money, looks, and a body like this. Miss this chance,</p>
<p begin="01:47:39.080" end="01:47:40.400" style="s2">and there won&#39;t be another.</p>
<p begin="01:47:40.640" end="01:47:44.120" style="s2">Mr. Fu, is this a proposal or a clearance sale?</p>
<p begin="01:47:44.360" end="01:47:45.680" style="s2">Forcing a sale on me?</p>
<p begin="01:47:48.080" end="01:47:48.920" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:47:49.520" end="01:47:50.600" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you time to think it over.</p>
<p begin="01:47:54.440" end="01:47:58.519" style="s2">I thought I could walk away without hesitation, but...</p>
<p begin="01:47:58.520" end="01:48:00.560" style="s2">Why is it so hard to let go?</p>
<p begin="01:48:01.160" end="01:48:04.640" style="s2">Let&#39;s just say I&#39;m selfish—stealing a little more time.</p>
<p begin="01:48:17.240" end="01:48:21.199" style="s2">Days like this feel like a dream. If...</p>
<p begin="01:48:21.200" end="01:48:23.960" style="s2">If only I didn&#39;t have to choose, and we could stay like this forever.</p>
<p begin="01:48:24.080" end="01:48:26.719" style="s2">Host, capture progress updated.</p>
<p begin="01:48:26.720" end="01:48:28.639" style="s2">Target: FuXiaoTing.</p>
<p begin="01:48:28.640" end="01:48:31.640" style="s2">Current capture completion: ninety-nine percent.</p>
<p begin="01:48:33.920" end="01:48:36.320" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong? Was the movie too scary?</p>
<p begin="01:48:41.840" end="01:48:42.680" style="s2">Yeah, scared me.</p>
<p begin="01:48:44.000" end="01:48:45.800" style="s2">It&#39;s okay. I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="01:48:46.520" end="01:48:47.480" style="s2">I&#39;m so stupid.</p>
<p begin="01:48:48.080" end="01:48:52.639" style="s2">Thinking I could stall and control my feelings. But where the heart goes—</p>
<p begin="01:48:52.640" end="01:48:55.760" style="s2">—was never up to me. FuXiaoTing...</p>
<p begin="01:48:56.240" end="01:48:57.320" style="s2">I might...</p>
<p begin="01:48:57.920" end="01:48:59.720" style="s2">really have to leave.</p>
<p begin="01:49:16.400" end="01:49:18.680" style="s2">Why are you up? Could&#39;ve slept longer.</p>
<p begin="01:49:19.400" end="01:49:20.960" style="s2">I want to memorize your face.</p>
<p begin="01:49:21.560" end="01:49:23.360" style="s2">If you ever cheat on me one day,</p>
<p begin="01:49:23.960" end="01:49:27.320" style="s2">I&#39;ll hire someone to paint your portrait and plaster it all over town.</p>
<p begin="01:49:27.680" end="01:49:30.200" style="s2">With &quot;CHEATER&quot; written on it.</p>
<p begin="01:49:30.920" end="01:49:31.760" style="s2">FuXiaoTing.</p>
<p begin="01:49:35.960" end="01:49:39.440" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you the entire Ravencrest Estate. But if that day ever comes</p>
<p begin="01:49:39.920" end="01:49:41.240" style="s2">and you throw me out—</p>
<p begin="01:49:43.520" end="01:49:44.480" style="s2">FuXiaoTing.</p>
<p begin="01:49:46.040" end="01:49:47.120" style="s2">If one day</p>
<p begin="01:49:48.320" end="01:49:49.280" style="s2">I left,</p>
<p begin="01:49:50.000" end="01:49:50.960" style="s2">what would you do?</p>
<p begin="01:49:52.280" end="01:49:53.120" style="s2">Where would you go?</p>
<p begin="01:49:54.680" end="01:49:56.600" style="s2">I said, hypothetically.</p>
<p begin="01:49:57.320" end="01:49:58.280" style="s2">Just a what-if.</p>
<p begin="01:49:59.000" end="01:49:59.960" style="s2">Then I&#39;d come find you.</p>
<p begin="01:50:00.560" end="01:50:01.400" style="s2">No matter where you are.</p>
<p begin="01:50:01.760" end="01:50:05.359" style="s2">Congratulations, Host. Target&#39;s emotional response has peaked.</p>
<p begin="01:50:05.360" end="01:50:07.159" style="s2">Capture progress final confirmation: one hundred percent.</p>
<p begin="01:50:07.160" end="01:50:10.400" style="s2">Portal to the original world now opening. Countdown—</p>
<p begin="01:50:11.000" end="01:50:11.720" style="s2">Nine.</p>
<p begin="01:50:13.280" end="01:50:14.240" style="s2">FuXiaoTing...</p>
<p begin="01:50:15.560" end="01:50:16.400" style="s2">I love you.</p>
<p begin="01:50:42.560" end="01:50:43.400" style="s2">YuYang</p>
<p begin="01:50:49.160" end="01:50:51.320" style="s2">Sir, what happened?</p>
<p begin="01:50:52.160" end="01:50:53.120" style="s2">She vanished.</p>
<p begin="01:50:53.960" end="01:50:54.800" style="s2">She&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="01:50:55.280" end="01:50:58.520" style="s2">Sir, you—you can talk again!</p>
<p begin="01:50:59.960" end="01:51:02.960" style="s2">Rest assured, I&#39;ll mobilize everyone right now.</p>
<p begin="01:51:03.200" end="01:51:06.440" style="s2">Even if we have to search all of Country S, we&#39;ll find Butler Yun.</p>
<p begin="01:51:08.720" end="01:51:10.640" style="s2">Country S doesn&#39;t have McDonald&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="01:51:12.080" end="01:51:13.520" style="s2">No Peking Duck.</p>
<p begin="01:51:14.600" end="01:51:16.760" style="s2">And no YuYang with living parents.</p>
<p begin="01:51:18.080" end="01:51:19.160" style="s2">Her home</p>
<p begin="01:51:20.840" end="01:51:22.160" style="s2">isn&#39;t here with us.</p>
<p begin="01:51:40.160" end="01:51:43.519" style="s2">Yangyang, you&#39;re awake! You scared me!</p>
<p begin="01:51:43.520" end="01:51:44.600" style="s2">you suddenly fainted.</p>
<p begin="01:51:46.280" end="01:51:47.120" style="s2">Xiaoyun.</p>
<p begin="01:51:47.840" end="01:51:49.280" style="s2">I think I</p>
<p begin="01:51:50.000" end="01:51:52.400" style="s2">had such a long, long dream.</p>
<p begin="01:51:52.760" end="01:51:55.399" style="s2">You must be exhausted from that recent promotion.</p>
<p begin="01:51:55.400" end="01:51:56.600" style="s2">Go home and get some proper rest.</p>
<p begin="01:51:59.600" end="01:52:02.840" style="s2">When did you buy that new necklace? What a unique design.</p>
<p begin="01:52:08.240" end="01:52:09.440" style="s2">So</p>
<p begin="01:52:10.520" end="01:52:11.720" style="s2">none of it</p>
<p begin="01:52:12.320" end="01:52:13.520" style="s2">was a dream.</p>
<p begin="01:52:24.440" end="01:52:29.600" style="s2">Time flies by, and my life seems utterly unchanged.</p>
<p begin="01:52:29.960" end="01:52:32.360" style="s2">I found a normal, stable job.</p>
<p begin="01:52:33.440" end="01:52:34.760" style="s2">Nine to five.</p>
<p begin="01:52:35.960" end="01:52:37.040" style="s2">But my heart</p>
<p begin="01:52:37.640" end="01:52:40.040" style="s2">seems to have stayed in another dimension.</p>
<p begin="01:52:41.000" end="01:52:45.080" style="s2">Late at night, I&#39;ve begged countless times to see him just once more.</p>
<p begin="01:52:46.280" end="01:52:47.360" style="s2">But fate</p>
<p begin="01:52:47.960" end="01:52:50.960" style="s2">seems to have stopped favoring me.</p>
<p begin="01:53:34.160" end="01:53:35.360" style="s2">FuXiaoTing.</p>
<p begin="01:53:35.600" end="01:53:37.760" style="s2">YuYang. Long time no see.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
